gine clamps to generic.\n- \"Whenever this attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost.\" — attack trigger (`AttacksTriggeredEvent`), optional free cast.\n- \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\" — zone replacement on the free-cast spell.\n\nTASK:\n1. Read the spec, the tests, and the relevant engine/FDN code.\n2. Implement the card in `cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`, adding engine support as needed.\n3. Run the card's tests until ALL pass: `pytest cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py -q`\n4. Run a quick regression sanity check that you did not break the engine: `pytest engine_tests/ -q`\n\nOUTPUT (into $CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1`):\n- `impl.diff` — `git diff` of all your changes (card + engine).\n- `impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented, engine changes made and why, any design decisions or spec deviations.\n- `impl-files.txt` — list of files you created/modified, one per line.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_1\"`; replace in place if present). Entry shape:\n  {\"card\": \"sos_1\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}]}\n\nReturn ONLY the status block:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n\nOR if a test is genuinely wrong/impossible:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2901,"cache_read_input_tokens":24629,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2901},"output_tokens":35,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available