{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_012SwAjXVSwJbHCT3oD4Sfce","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BUXrpUcPoFnDtJgs1rCmzX","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"Persistent conventions and decisions across runs. Append-only.\n","new_string":"Persistent conventions and decisions across runs. Append-only.\n\n## Engine: \"exile instead of graveyard\" for free-cast spells (sos_1)\nFor a non-permanent spell with \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard,\nexile it instead\": set `card._exile_instead_of_graveyard = True` on the spell\nobject before casting it. `engine/casting.py::_resolve_spell` honors this opt-in\nflag and routes the resolving instant/sorcery from the stack to `Zone.EXILE`\ninstead of `Zone.GRAVEYARD`, then clears the flag (one-shot). Additive and\nbackward-compatible (flag defaults absent). Reuse for cast-from-graveyard /\nimpulse effects with the same rider.\n\n## Convention: cost_reduction hook reads self.controller (sos_1)\nOverride `CardImpl.cost_reduction(game)` for \"costs {N} less\" effects; the engine\nclamps the reduction to the generic portion of the cost in\n`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` (`max(0, min(raw, generic))`), so no manual\nclamping is needed. The hook may read `self.controller` (engine sets it before\nquerying).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2072,"cache_read_input_tokens":31680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2072},"output_tokens":45,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"3c8ebbf2-f210-47f2-b340-adb06c352437","request_id":"req_011CbdSQvvPgSZdtpQSRZCF7"}
