nt of the card cannot be tested with the current engine/test API, write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/untestable.json` — a JSON array of `{\"requirement\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"what_would_unblock\": \"...\"}`. Omit the file entirely if everything is testable.\n\nReturn ONLY a short status summary: number of tests written, the test file path, and untestable_count (0 if none)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011HUENwXSVrgSUMrGyXJyB2","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"8b9826df-18c8-4c1d-83ac-44dabb59e505","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:52:46.329Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_4"}
