{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01393NKQCc4QKecNFnibEHqC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent conventions and decisions across runs. Append-only.\n4\t\n5\t## Engine: \"exile instead of graveyard\" for free-cast spells (sos_1)\n6\tFor a non-permanent spell with \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard,\n7\texile it instead\": set `card._exile_instead_of_graveyard = True` on the spell\n8\tobject before casting it. `engine/casting.py::_resolve_spell` honors this opt-in\n9\tflag and routes the resolving instant/sorcery from the stack to `Zone.EXILE`\n10\tinstead of `Zone.GRAVEYARD`, then clears the flag (one-shot). Additive and\n11\tbackward-compatible (flag defaults absent). Reuse for cast-from-graveyard /\n12\timpulse effects with the same rider.\n13\t\n14\t## Convention: cost_reduction hook reads self.controller (sos_1)\n15\tOverride `CardImpl.cost_reduction(game)` for \"costs {N} less\" effects; the engine\n16\tclamps the reduction to the generic portion of the cost in\n17\t`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` (`max(0, min(raw, generic))`), so no manual\n18\tclamping is needed. The hook may read `self.controller` (engine sets it before\n19\tquerying).\n20\t\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015rSgz2BDumnJvov7opEmVD","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"e2666a12-ac7b-4d96-ab3d-37d144c7ed62","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:00:43.270Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
