f {X} symbols in the cost.\n155-        hybrid: List of hybrid mana symbols that can be paid with either option.\n156-    \"\"\"\n157-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015rSgz2BDumnJvov7opEmVD","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"b1151077-910a-49a6-b7c4-819d2055380b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:01:07.767Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
