{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014vc8VgTaFiH3PT8x8rDmo6","type":"tool_result","content":"353\tdef create_token(game: GameState, player: Player, token: Any) -> None:\n354\t    \"\"\"Create a token on the battlefield under *player*'s control.\n355\t\n356\t    Sets ``is_token = True`` on the token, along with ``owner`` and\n357\t    ``controller``.  Uses :func:`move_to_zone` for entering-battlefield\n358\t    hooks (trigger/replacement-effect registration and ETB event).\n359\t\n360\t    Parameters:\n361\t        game: The current game state.\n362\t        player: The player who controls the token.\n363\t        token: The token object to place on the battlefield.\n364\t    \"\"\"\n365\t    token.is_token = True\n366\t    token.owner = player\n367\t    token.controller = player\n368\t\n369\t    # Tokens don't come from an existing zone — add directly and fire hooks.\n370\t    # Ordering matches move_to_zone: fire ETB *before* registering the token's\n371\t    # own triggers so a token's ETB trigger doesn't self-fire on entry.\n372\t    battlefield = game.get_battlefield(player)\n373\t    battlefield.add(token)\n374\t\n375\t    game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n376\t        game,\n377\t        EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent=token, controller=player),\n378\t    )\n379\t\n380\t    # Register triggers/replacement effects after the ETB event.\n381\t    if hasattr(token, \"register_triggers\"):\n382\t        token.register_triggers(game)\n383\t    if hasattr(token, \"register_replacement_effects\"):\n384\t        token.register_replacement_effects(game)\n385\t\n386\t\n387\tdef add_counter(\n388\t    game: GameState,\n389\t    permanent: Any,\n390\t    counter_type: str,\n391\t    amount: int = 1,\n392\t) -> None:\n393\t    \"\"\"Add *amount* counters of *counter_type* to *permanent*.\n394\t\n395\t    Supports ``\"+1/+1\"`` and ``\"-1/-1\"`` counter types via the\n396\t    ``plus_one_counters`` / ``minus_one_counters`` attributes.  For other\n397\t    counter types, uses a generic ``counters`` dict.\n398\t\n399\t    Parameters:\n400\t        game: The current game state.\n401\t        permanent: The permanent to add counters to.\n402\t        counter_type: The type of counter (e.g. ``\"+1/+1\"``, ``\"-1/-1\"``,\n403\t            ``\"loyalty\"``, ``\"charge\"``).\n404\t        amount: Number of counters to add (default 1).\n405\t    \"\"\"\n406\t    if amount <= 0:\n407\t        return\n408\t\n409\t    if counter_type == \"+1/+1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"plus_one_counters\"):\n410\t        permanent.plus_one_counters += amount\n411\t    elif counter_type == \"-1/-1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"minus_one_counters\"):\n412\t        permanent.minus_one_counters += amount"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqRrGT3e6vnefGAH5ufqMX","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"7e8b244c-57cf-458d-8416-a564ebe2f7ca","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:36.686Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_13 with preparation API"}
