{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Voa7osZnPbvL1CXViakmrm","type":"tool_result","content":"total 52\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node  4096 Jun  2 00:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node  4096 Jun  2 00:00 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  3265 Jun  2 00:06 coordinator-directives.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node    30 Jun  2 00:10 impl-files.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  4514 Jun  2 00:10 impl-rationale.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 11380 Jun  2 00:10 impl.diff\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node    37 Jun  2 00:04 test-files.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  5704 Jun  2 00:04 test-rationale.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  2121 Jun  2 00:04 untestable.json\n---\n# Test rationale — sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## Card mechanics\n\nThis is a **preparation card** (CR 722), a two-part card:\n\n- **Front face — Emeritus of Truce**: `{1}{W}{W}`, 3/3 white Creature — Cat Cleric.\n  - ETB trigger: *\"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white\n    and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls\n    more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\"*\n- **Inset \"prepare spell\" — Swords to Plowshares**: `{W}` Instant — *\"Exile\n  target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.\"*\n  - While the creature is prepared, its controller may cast a copy of the\n    prepare spell from exile; doing so unprepares it (CR 722.3c).\n\nThe engine has **no native \"Prepared\" designation, no preparation-card frame,\nand no split-card support**. The Implementer therefore has latitude over the\ninternal representation. The tests assert *observable behaviour* and probe the\nlikely attribute/method shapes tolerantly (e.g. `card.prepared` /\n`card.is_prepared`, a token's `colors` / `subtypes`, a prepare-spell factory).\n\n## Test file\n\n`cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py`\n\n### `TestEmeritusProperties` — printed front-face characteristics\n- `test_is_creature` — it is a `Creature` and has `CardType.CREATURE`.\n- `test_name` — name matches the spec (`Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares`).\n- `test_mana_cost` — `{1}{W}{W}`.\n- `test_power_toughness` — base P/T 3/3.\n- `test_creature_subtypes` — Cat Cleric.\n- `test_is_white` — white color identity (`colors` contains `\"W\"`).\n\nThese pin the static data implied by `type_line`, `mana_cost`, and P/T.\n\n### `TestEmeritusEtbRegistration` — trigger wiring\n- `test_register_triggers_adds_etb` — `register_triggers` registers exactly one\n  `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` trigger for the card. Validates the \"When\n  this creature enters …\" clause is an ETB trigger (not a static/etc. ability).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqRrGT3e6vnefGAH5ufqMX","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"892c2c56-b9fa-4a0f-9d4e-4e2ddc3356b2","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:10:46.711Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_13 with preparation API"}
