{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013S3NwbGD4pQSn5jNywDzhj","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/zones.py:179:def move_to_zone(\nengine/zones.py-180-    game: GameState,\nengine/zones.py-181-    card: Any,\nengine/zones.py-182-    from_zone: Zone,\nengine/zones.py-183-    to_zone: Zone,\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-184-    *,\nengine/zones.py-185-    replacement_event: Any | None = None,\nengine/zones.py-186-) -> None:\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-187-    \"\"\"High-level zone transition with trigger/replacement-effect hooks.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-188-\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-189-    Centralises the bookkeeping that was previously duplicated across\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-190-    ``destroy()``, ``sacrifice()``, ``exile()``, ``create_token()``,\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-191-    ``_move_to_graveyard()`` (SBAs), and ``_resolve_spell()`` (casting).\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-192-\nengine/zones.py-193-    Steps:\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-194-    1. Consult replacement effects for zone-change redirection (if\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-195-       *replacement_event* is supplied and the card is leaving the\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-196-       battlefield).  The replacement may change the destination zone\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-197-       (e.g. exile instead of graveyard) or set ``prevented = True`` to\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-198-       signal that it handled the zone move directly.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-199-    2. Remove *card* from the source zone.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-200-    3. Add *card* to the (possibly redirected) destination zone.\nengine/zones.py-201-    4. If leaving the battlefield:\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-202-       a. Fire ``LeavesBattlefieldTriggeredEvent``.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-203-       b. Fire ``CreatureDiesTriggeredEvent`` if the card is a creature\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-204-          **and** the final destination is the graveyard.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-205-       c. Unregister triggers and replacement effects (fires happen\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-206-          **before** unregister so self-referencing triggers still match).\nengine/zones.py-207-    5. If entering the battlefield:\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-208-       a. Register triggers (``register_triggers``) and replacement\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-209-          effects (``register_replacement_effects``).\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-210-       b. Fire ``EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent``.\n/workspace/engine/zones.py-211-\nengine/zones.py-212-    Parameters:\nengine/zones.py-213-        game: The current game state.\nengine/zones.py-214-        card: The game object being moved."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014XeaoWYfsVtkKELfbWWq5K","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"b8c42650-e2ef-4e5e-8ff1-714492bd6518","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:15:03.148Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend & fix tests for sos_13"}
