{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01PpSgHGvsfhcT9impxooML1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GC7UUFCdbQMVdxB3rETAyS","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/coordinator-directives.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4744,"cache_read_input_tokens":8113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4744,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TVa2cvAS9Afwfa5auR6Am5","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"dbac56fd-f83b-4956-90e0-54219f5d3a09","request_id":"req_011CbdUKTeQK4a4ef2Z3noN6","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Final pass sos_13 standard counting"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GC7UUFCdbQMVdxB3rETAyS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator directives — sos_13 (round 2: Tester extension + counting fix)\n2\t\n3\tThe first Implementer pass built the preparation API. Two follow-ups are needed.\n4\t\n5\t## A. Counting-model correction (IMPORTANT — affects both Tester and Implementer)\n6\tCard ETB: \"target player creates a 1/1 W/B flying Inkling. THEN if an opponent\n7\tcontrols more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\"\n8\t\n9\tUse **STANDARD MTG counting**:\n10\t- The entering Emeritus is on the battlefield when its own ETB resolves, so it\n11\t  **counts toward \"you\"** (the controller). Do NOT subtract it.\n12\t- Tokens count for whoever controls them.\n13\t- \"more than\" is strict `>`.\n14\t\n15\tThe test `TestEmeritusBecomesPrepared::test_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures`\n16\tcurrently sets opponent=2 creatures and targets the Inkling token to the\n17\tCONTROLLER, then asserts `prepared is True`. Under standard counting that board\n18\tis controller = Emeritus + token = 2 vs opponent = 2 → NOT more → NOT prepared,\n19\tso the assertion is wrong (the test comment \"controller controls only Emeritus\n20\t(1)\" overlooked that the controller's own token bumps the count).\n21\t\n22\tTESTER: fix ONLY that one test's board so the \"prepared\" case is genuinely\n23\t\"opponent strictly more than you\" under standard counting. Simplest fix: target\n24\tthe Inkling token to the OPPONENT (so opp = 2 bears + token = 3 vs controller =\n25\tEmeritus = 1 → prepared), or give the opponent 3 bears with the token to the\n26\tcontroller (opp 3 > controller 2). Keep the test's intent (opp-more → prepared)\n27\tand keep the token-created-before-check ordering. The other three\n28\tbecomes-prepared tests already pass under standard counting — leave them.\n29\t\n30\tIMPLEMENTER (final pass): the becomes-prepared check must count the entering\n31\tEmeritus toward the controller (standard rules). Remove any \"subtract the\n32\tentering creature\" adjustment.\n33\t\n34\t## B. Extend coverage for the two previously-untestable requirements\n35\tThe card now exposes (keep these exact names stable):\n36\t- `prepared: bool` (+ `is_prepared` read-only alias)\n37\t- `make_prepare_spell(self, game)` → castable Swords to Plowshares instance\n38\t- `cast_prepare_spell(self, game, target=None)` → requires prepared, free-casts a\n39\t  copy, then sets `prepared = False`.\n40\t\n41\tTESTER: extend `cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` to:\n42\t1. Harden the previously skip-guarded Swords-to-Plowshares tests — they now run\n43\t   because `make_prepare_spell` is exposed (no behavior change needed; just make\n44\t   sure they assert exile + victim-controller lifegain as hard tests).\n45\t2. Add a test for the unprepare-on-cast transition: prepare the creature\n46\t   (`prepared = True`), put a target creature on the battlefield, call\n47\t   `cast_prepare_spell(game, target=...)`, then assert (a) the target was exiled\n48\t   and its controller gained life, and (b) `card.prepared is False` afterward\n49\t   (CR 722.3c). Also assert calling `cast_prepare_spell` when NOT prepared\n50\t   raises / is rejected.\n51\t\n52\tUpdate `test-rationale.md` and `test-files.txt` accordingly. Do NOT touch\n53\t`engine_tests/` or any `cards/fdn/**/tests.py`.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TVa2cvAS9Afwfa5auR6Am5","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"cf2e9088-d63f-4705-aac2-159a67bddc1c","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:17:14.998Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Final pass sos_13 standard counting"}
