{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_019mhgUBZeuyY9QCwZKMxoYS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A2uTRDiduph7vRj42eDhm7","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-final-rationale.md","content":"# sos_13 — final pass rationale (counting-model correction)\n\n## Change\nCorrected the \"becomes prepared\" comparison in\n`cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py::EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares._opponent_controls_more_creatures`\nto use **standard MTG counting** (per coordinator directives, section A).\n\nPreviously the method subtracted the entering Emeritus from the controller's\ncreature total:\n\n```python\nmy_count = self._creature_count(game, controller)\nif game.get_battlefield(controller).contains(self):\n    my_count -= 1\n```\n\nThat extra subtraction was removed. The controller's count is now simply:\n\n```python\nmy_count = self._creature_count(game, controller)\n```\n\n## Why this is rules-correct\nThe card's ETB resolves while Emeritus is already on the battlefield (CR 722.3a\nis evaluated at resolution). Under standard MTG counting:\n\n- The entering **Emeritus counts toward \"you\"** (its controller) — no subtraction.\n- The just-created **Inkling token counts for whoever controls it** (the\n  targeted player). The token is still created *before* the comparison, so a\n  token given to an opponent bumps that opponent's count and a token given to\n  the controller bumps the controller's count.\n- **\"More than\" is strict `>`** — equal counts do not prepare the creature.\n\nSo the predicate is now: some opponent's full creature count is strictly greater\nthan the controller's full creature count (Emeritus + any controlled tokens\nincluded).\n\n## API stability\nNo public surface changed. The exposed names remain:\n- `prepared: bool` (+ read-only `is_prepared` alias)\n- `make_prepare_spell(self, game)`\n- `cast_prepare_spell(self, game, target=None)`\n\n## Engine impact\nNone. The change is confined to one method body in the card file — no engine\nfiles touched, no renames/moves/deletes.\n\n## Tests\n- `pytest cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py -q` → **25 passed**.\n- `pytest engine_tests/ -q` → **1145 passed** (no regressions).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":31286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":343,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TVa2cvAS9Afwfa5auR6Am5","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"fe21c413-f4c8-4ffa-9482-2bbd110a803f","request_id":"req_011CbdUN4auhh9ZxtnGTN4HL","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Final pass sos_13 standard counting"}
