at each test covers and why; note the card's mechanics.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-files.txt` — list of test file path(s), one per line.\n- If any requirement cannot be tested with the current engine/test API, write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/untestable.json` — JSON array of `{\"requirement\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"what_would_unblock\": \"...\"}`. Omit if everything is testable.\n\nReturn ONLY a short status summary: number of tests written, the test file path, and untestable_count (0 if none)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":87937,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":210},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"8f87e9b5-bf84-4866-962c-8518baf14d9d","request_id":"req_011CbdUYZms2pZBQp5iExwwj"}
