{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RXPWZNsRPQxjRZq2ew7mWp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JTbhNLSWJjXmqSfa6WnMu3","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Implement sos_57 with delayed-trigger engine support","subagent_type":"Implementer","prompt":"You are implementing a single MTG card (TDD green phase) AND adding additive engine support the coordinator has directed.\n\nCARD: sos_57 (Mana Sculpt — {1}{U}{U} Instant)\n- Spec: `cards/sos/sos_57/card_spec.json`\n- Implementation file: `cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py`\n- Tests to make pass are listed in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-files.txt` (currently `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`).\n- **REQUIRED READING: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/coordinator-directives.md`** — it mandates two additive engine features (total mana-spent tracking; a beginning-of-main-phase event + delayed one-shot deferred-effect mechanism) and the exact behavior. Follow it precisely; the coordinator re-runs the Tester against the surface you expose.\n\nCARD BEHAVIOR: \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n- Counter is unconditional: target spell → owner's graveyard, never resolves. Targets ANY spell (creature or noncreature) on the stack; rejects self; needs a spell on the stack to be castable.\n- Wizard gate: deferred {C} only if controller controls a creature with the `Wizard` subtype at resolution.\n- Deferred {C} == total mana spent to cast the countered spell, added at controller's NEXT precombat main phase (NOT immediately).\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Do NOT modify any test file in `test-files.txt`, nor `engine_tests/`, nor `cards/fdn/**/tests.py`. If a test is genuinely impossible, return DISPUTE.\n- Engine changes ALLOWED and expected: add methods/classes/helpers/files; modify existing function bodies (incl. `engine/turn.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/casting.py`). You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete existing engine symbols. Keep ALL existing engine behavior intact.\n- Read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_MAP.md`, `KEY_DECISIONS.md` first (KEY_DECISIONS has reusable conventions).\n\nREFERENCE: existing counter/targeting FDN cards (`cards/fdn/fdn_*/card_impl.py`), and engine source: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/casting.py` (`colors_spent`/`last_payment_colors`), `engine/turn.py`, `engine/zones.py`, `engine/mana.py` (or wherever the mana pool lives). Grep RULEBOOK.txt for counter/\"mana spent\" rules if needed.\n\nTASK:\n1. Read directives, spec, tests, engine source.\n2. Add `card.mana_spent` (total mana paid) tracking during `cast_spell` payment, additive like `colors_spent`.\n3. Add a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` (engine/events.py), fire it from turn.py on entering precombat main, and a delayed one-shot deferred-effect mechanism keyed to the controller. Document the exact event class name + constructor args + how a test fires it and reads the {C} pool, in your rationale.\n4. Implement Mana Sculpt: counter target spell; if Wizard, schedule the deferred {C} == countered spell's `mana_spent` at controller's next main phase; not immediate.\n5. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py -q` until all pass.\n6. Run `pytest engine_tests/ -q` — ALL must still pass (no regressions).\n\nOUTPUT (into $CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`):\n- `impl.diff` — `git diff` of all changes (card + engine).\n- `impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented; the EXACT engine surface (event class name + args, deferred-effect registration API, mana_spent field), engine changes and why, design decisions / spec deviations.\n- `impl-files.txt` — files created/modified, one per line.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_57\"`; replace in place). Entry shape:\n  {\"card\": \"sos_57\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"