the deferred {C} == countered spell's `mana_spent` at controller's next main phase; not immediate.\n5. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py -q` until all pass.\n6. Run `pytest engine_tests/ -q` — ALL must still pass (no regressions).\n\nOUTPUT (into $CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`):\n- `impl.diff` — `git diff` of all changes (card + engine).\n- `impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented; the EXACT engine surface (event class name + args, deferred-effect registration API, mana_spent field), engine changes and why, design decisions / spec deviations.\n- `impl-files.txt` — files created/modified, one per line.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_57\"`; replace in place). Entry shape:\n  {\"card\": \"sos_57\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}]}\n\nReturn ONLY:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line, INCLUDING the BeginningOfMainPhase event class name and how to fire it>\n\nOR:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>","agentId":"a8f7b55f9ddbbbc04","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All complete. 1166 tests pass (21 card + 1145 engine), no regressions, and all output files are written.\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 7\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Event class `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat=True)` in engine/events.py; fire via `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=ctrl, controller=ctrl, precombat=True))` — delivery runs synchronously, adding `mana_spent` {C} once to the controller's pool.