{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_012r35h8Robv43hW6QnU6Yqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DsYTKVgqMw1y7JKSbLEp4z","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","old_string":"- `test_mana_not_added_immediately_even_with_wizard` — even with a Wizard the\n  {C} is NOT in the pool the instant Mana Sculpt resolves (it is deferred to the\n  next main phase). Guards against an implementation that pays immediately.\n\n## Edge cases covered","new_string":"- `test_mana_not_added_immediately_even_with_wizard` — even with a Wizard the\n  {C} is NOT in the pool the instant Mana Sculpt resolves (it is deferred to the\n  next main phase). Guards against an implementation that pays immediately.\n\n### TestManaSculptDeferredDelivery — deterministic delivery of the deferred {C}\nThe implementation now exposes a stable surface for \"at the beginning of your\nnext main phase\": resolution schedules a one-shot deferred effect, and firing\n`BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=controller, controller=controller,\nprecombat=True)` runs it synchronously, reading the countered spell's\n`card.mana_spent` (the converted cost actually paid) to add that much {C} to the\ncontroller's pool. These tests drive that full path end-to-end:\n- `test_deferred_colorless_not_in_pool_at_resolution` — with a Wizard and a\n  `{1}{R}` bolt (`mana_spent == 2`), the controller's {C} pool is still 0\n  immediately after resolution (deferred, not immediate).\n- `test_deferred_colorless_added_at_next_main_phase` — firing the controller's\n  precombat `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` adds exactly `mana_spent` (2)\n  {C} to the controller's pool.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_scales_with_larger_spend` — a `{3}{G}{G}` spell\n  (`mana_spent == 5`) delivers exactly 5 {C} at the next main phase, proving the\n  delivered amount tracks the mana actually spent.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_is_one_shot` — firing the main-phase event a SECOND\n  time adds no further {C}; the deferred effect is consumed exactly once.\n- `test_no_wizard_nothing_delivered_at_next_main_phase` — without a Wizard no\n  deferred effect is scheduled, so firing the main-phase event delivers no {C}\n  at all (counter still happens).\n\n## Edge cases covered"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2543,"cache_read_input_tokens":41921,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2543,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01T8WgoRHFrkSL8YETG73Xex","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"4c85d6dc-1969-4e54-b6c4-88f2afdacc5d","request_id":"req_011CbdVYLMLHGX9iFRzQXZGD","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Add delivery test for sos_57"}
