{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T8WgoRHFrkSL8YETG73Xex","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_REWRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 26\n\nDelivery tests added (new `TestManaSculptDeferredDelivery` class in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`):\n- `test_deferred_colorless_not_in_pool_at_resolution` — Wizard + `{1}{R}` bolt (`mana_spent == 2`); {C} pool still 0 right after resolution (deferred).\n- `test_deferred_colorless_added_at_next_main_phase` — firing `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(precombat=True)` adds exactly 2 {C}.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_scales_with_larger_spend` — `{3}{G}{G}` (`mana_spent == 5`) delivers exactly 5 {C}.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_is_one_shot` — firing the event a second time adds no more {C}.\n- `test_no_wizard_nothing_delivered_at_next_main_phase` — no Wizard, no deferred {C} delivered (counter still happens).\n\nAll 26 tests pass (21 existing intact + 5 new). Edited only `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`.\n\nuntestable_count: 0\n\nOutputs updated in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`:\n- `test-rationale.md` — added `TestManaSculptDeferredDelivery` section; revised \"NOT covered\" notes (both prior items now covered).\n- `test-files.txt` — lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`.\n- `untestable.json` — now `[]`."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a4e6cdab3e7b118df (use SendMessage with to: 'a4e6cdab3e7b118df' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 48670\ntool_uses: 23\nduration_ms: 103264</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"af688592-4898-4552-85cb-c20ab838c7c4","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:33:54.374Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"You are adding ONE area of coverage to your existing tests for a card. The implementation now exposes a concrete, stable surface for the previously-untestable \"deferred {C} at the beginning of your next main phase\" requirement.\n\nCARD: sos_57 (Mana Sculpt)\n- Test file you OWN and will edit: `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`\n- Implementation in place: `cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py`\n- Card behavior: \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n\nSTABLE ENGINE SURFACE TO TEST AGAINST (now implemented):\n- `card.mana_spent: int` — set by `cast_spell` to the converted mana actually paid (after reduction). Read via `getattr(card, \"mana_spent\", 0)`.\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=<Player>, controller=<Player>, precombat=<bool>)` in `engine/events.py`. Firing it via `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game, BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=controller, controller=controller, precombat=True))` runs the scheduled deferred effect SYNCHRONOUSLY (no stack resolve needed), adding the deferred {C} to the controller's mana pool exactly once. Firing again is a no-op.\n- The colorless mana is read from the controller's mana pool, e.g. `controller.mana_pool.get(ManaType.COLORLESS)` (confirm the exact pool API by reading `test_utils.py` / `engine/mana.py` / the existing tests).\n\nTASK — add a new test class/tests covering deterministic DELIVERY:\n1. Set up a Wizard under the controller's control, put a target spell on the stack whose cast spent a known amount of mana (so `mana_spent` is known, e.g. a {1}{R} bolt → 2). Resolve Mana Sculpt (counter + schedule). Assert the controller's {C} pool is still empty immediately after resolution (deferred, not immediate).\n2. Then fire `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` for the controller (precombat=True) and assert the controller's {C} pool gained exactly the deferred amount (== the countered spell's mana_spent).\n3. Assert firing the event a SECOND time does NOT add more {C} (one-shot).\n4. (Optional) Assert that with NO Wizard, no deferred {C} is scheduled, so firing the event adds nothing.\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Edit ONLY `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`. Do NOT touch `engine_tests/` or `cards/fdn/**/tests.py`.\n- Keep all existing 21 tests intact and passing.\n- Read `test_utils.py`, `engine/mana.py`/`engine/events.py`, and your existing tests to use the correct pool/event APIs.\n\nVERIFY: `pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py -q` — all tests (existing + new) must pass.\n\nOUTPUT (into $CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`):\n- Update `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` in place.\n- Update `test-rationale.md` (note the new delivery tests).\n- Ensure `test-files.txt` lists the test file.\n- Empty `untestable.json` to `[]` (both requirements are now covered).\n\nReturn ONLY a short status summary: total test_cases now, the delivery tests added, and untestable_count (0).","agentId":"a4e6cdab3e7b118df","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_REWRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 26\n\nDelivery tests added (new `TestManaSculptDeferredDelivery` class in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`):\n- `test_deferred_colorless_not_in_pool_at_resolution` — Wizard + `{1}{R}` bolt (`mana_spent == 2`); {C} pool still 0 right after resolution (deferred).\n- `test_deferred_colorless_added_at_next_main_phase` — firing `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(precombat=True)` adds exactly 2 {C}.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_scales_with_larger_spend` — `{3}{G}{G}` (`mana_spent == 5`) delivers exactly 5 {C}.\n- `test_deferred_delivery_is_one_shot` — firing the event a second time adds no more {C}.\n- `test_no_wizard_nothing_delivered_at_next_main_phase` — no Wizard, no deferred {C} delivered (counter still happens).\n\nAll 26 tests pass (21 existing intact + 5 new). Edited only `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`.\n\nuntestable_count: 0\n\nOutputs updated in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57`:\n- `test-rationale.md` — added `TestManaSculptDeferredDelivery` section; revised \"NOT covered\" notes (both prior items now covered).\n- `test-files.txt` — lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`.\n- `untestable.json` — now `[]`."}],"totalDurationMs":