{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RQ3XWgn3kh6gjoe6iscJxU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C3AFWo1WbghCRxTm3j29qx","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)","new_string":"## Engine: mana-spent tracking, delayed main-phase triggers, spell/ability marker (sos_57)\n- `card.mana_spent: int` — set by `engine/casting.py::cast_spell` to the\n  converted mana actually paid (after cost reduction, `effective_cost.cmc`),\n  analogous to `card.colors_spent`; `cast_spell_free` sets 0. Read via\n  `getattr(card, \"mana_spent\", 0)`. Use for any \"amount of mana spent to cast\"\n  rider. (Known gap: ignores {X} payments — would under-count X-spells.)\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat=True)` in\n  `engine/events.py`, fired by `engine/turn.py` on entering precombat/postcombat\n  main phases. Paired with `GameState.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(\n  controller, callback, *, precombat=True)` (registry on GameState; delivery via\n  `engine/deferred.py::deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects`, run SYNCHRONOUSLY\n  inside `TriggerManager.fire_event` for that event type). This is the general\n  \"at the beginning of your next main phase, do X once\" mechanism. A test fires\n  it directly: `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game,\n  BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=ctrl, controller=ctrl, precombat=True))`.\n  Effects are one-shot (removed on delivery).\n- `StackObject.is_spell: bool` (additive, default False) — set True only in the\n  casting pipeline (`cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`). Abilities on\n  the stack reuse their source permanent's `card_types`, so to distinguish a\n  SPELL from an ability on the stack (e.g. for \"counter target spell\"), check\n  `getattr(stack_obj, \"is_spell\", False)` rather than inspecting `card_types`.\n\n## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":112580,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204},"output_tokens":42,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"7c50fd30-2ad2-4b9f-867f-63d2bbcbd71d","request_id":"req_011CbdW55q5Lm1E7gyExZAVW"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C3AFWo1WbghCRxTm3j29qx","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"29882b4e-627d-43e7-bdd6-d3f941daf0e9","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:40:24.764Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)","newString":"## Engine: mana-spent tracking, delayed main-phase triggers, spell/ability marker (sos_57)\n- `card.mana_spent: int` — set by `engine/casting.py::cast_spell` to the\n  converted mana actually paid (after cost reduction, `effective_cost.cmc`),\n  analogous to `card.colors_spent`; `cast_spell_free` sets 0. Read via\n  `getattr(card, \"mana_spent\", 0)`. Use for any \"amount of mana spent to cast\"\n  rider. (Known gap: ignores {X} payments — would under-count X-spells.)\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat=True)` in\n  `engine/events.py`, fired by `engine/turn.py` on entering precombat/postcombat\n  main phases. Paired with `GameState.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(\n  controller, callback, *, precombat=True)` (registry on GameState; delivery via\n  `engine/deferred.py::deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects`, run SYNCHRONOUSLY\n  inside `TriggerManager.fire_event` for that event type). This is the general\n  \"at the beginning of your next main phase, do X once\" mechanism. A test fires\n  it directly: `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game,\n  BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=ctrl, controller=ctrl, precombat=True))`.\n  Effects are one-shot (removed on delivery).\n- `StackObject.is_spell: bool` (additive, default False) — set True only in the\n  casting pipeline (`cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`). Abilities on\n  the stack reuse their source permanent's `card_types`, so to distinguish a\n  SPELL from an ability on the stack (e.g. for \"counter target spell\"), check\n  `getattr(stack_obj, \"is_spell\", False)` rather than inspecting `card_types`.\n\n## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)","originalFile":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent conventions and decisions across runs. Append-only.\n\n## Engine: \"exile instead of graveyard\" for free-cast spells (sos_1)\nFor a non-permanent spell with \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard,\nexile it instead\": set `card._exile_instead_of_graveyard = True` on the spell\nobject before casting it. `engine/casting.py::_resolve_spell` honors this opt-in\nflag and routes the resolving instant/sorcery from the stack to `Zone.EXILE`\ninstead of `Zone.GRAVEYARD`, then clears the flag (one-shot). Additive and\nbackward-compatible (flag defaults absent). Reuse for cast-from-graveyard /\nimpulse effects with the same rider.\n\n## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)\nThe engine has no native preparation-card support. Implement a preparation card\n(two-part: a creature/permanent front face + an inset \"prepare spell\") as:\n- The inset prepare spell is its own `Instant`/`Sorcery` subclass in the same\n  `card_impl.py`, resolving via `chosen_targets`.\n- Front-face card exposes: `prepared: bool` (default False) + `is_prepared`\n  read-only alias property; `make_prepare_spell(self, game)` factory returning a\n  castable inset-spell instance; `cast_prepare_spell(self, game, target=None)`\n  which requires `prepared is True` (raise ValueError otherwise), free-casts a\n  copy of the prepare spell (without paying mana), then sets `prepared = False`\n  (unprepare per CR 722.3c).\n- \"Becomes prepared\" / \"more creatures than you\" comparisons use STANDARD MTG\n  counting: a creature is on the battlefield when its own ETB trigger resolves,\n  so it counts toward \"you\"; tokens count for their controller; \"more than\" is\n  strict `>`. Do NOT subtract the entering creature.\n\n## Convention: explicit colors attribute (sos_13)\nThe engine has no native colors field. Set `self.colors` (list of single-letter\nstrings, e.g. `[\"W\"]` or `[\"W\", \"B\"]`) explicitly on cards and tokens when color\nidentity must be observable.\n\n## Convention: cost_reduction hook reads self.controller (sos_1)\nOverride `CardImpl.cost_reduction(game)` for \"costs {N} less\" effects; the engine\nclamps the reduction to the generic portion of the cost in\n`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` (`max(0, min(raw, generic))`), so no manual\nclamping is needed. The hook may read `self.controller` (engine sets it before\nquerying).\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":11,"oldLines":6,"newStart":11,"newLines":28,"lines":[" backward-compatible (flag defaults absent). Reuse for cast-from-graveyard /"," impulse effects with the same rider."," ","+## Engine: mana-spent tracking, delayed main-phase triggers, spell/ability marker (sos_57)","+- `card.mana_spent: int` — set by `engine/casting.py::cast_spell` to the","+  converted mana actually paid (after cost reduction, `effective_cost.cmc`),","+  analogous to `card.colors_spent`; `cast_spell_free` sets 0. Read via","+  `getattr(card, \"mana_spent\", 0)`. Use for any \"amount of mana spent to cast\"","+  rider. (Known gap: ignores {X} payments — would under-count X-spells.)","+- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat=True)` in","+  `engine/events.py`, fired by `engine/turn.py` on entering precombat/postcombat","+  main phases. Paired with `GameState.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(","+  controller, callback, *, precombat=True)` (registry on GameState; delivery via","+  `engine/deferred.py::deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects`, run SYNCHRONOUSLY","+  inside `TriggerManager.fire_event` for that event type). This is the general","+  \"at the beginning of your next main phase, do X once\" mechanism. A test fires","+  it directly: `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game,","+  BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=ctrl, controller=ctrl, precombat=True))`.","+  Effects are one-shot (removed on delivery).","+- `StackObject.is_spell: bool` (additive, default False) — set True only in the","+  casting pipeline (`cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`). Abilities on","+  the stack reuse their source permanent's `card_types`, so to distinguish a","+  SPELL from an ability on the stack (e.g. for \"counter target spell\"), check","+  `getattr(stack_obj, \"is_spell\", False)` rather than inspecting `card_types`.","+"," ## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)"," The engine has no native preparation-card support. Implement a preparation card"," (two-part: a creature/permanent front face + an inset \"prepare spell\") as:"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
