est covers and why; note the card's mechanics.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-files.txt` — list of test file path(s), one per line.\n- If any requirement cannot be tested with the current engine/test API, write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/untestable.json` — JSON array of `{\"requirement\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"what_would_unblock\": \"...\"}`. Omit if everything is testable.\n\nReturn ONLY a short status summary: number of tests written, the test file path, and untestable_count (0 if none)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YB3rvTNXBxJC9UPZSMZC73","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"b4bd8205-b636-4cb4-a7d8-cfe1ab058e75","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:40:41.562Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_97"}
