{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01EDA4DZ3A7DkAHXygTB3BXH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BWydyRQfkdmnsouVoi97Jk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md 2>/dev/null | head -200; echo \"===FILES_MODIFIED===\"; cat /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json 2>/dev/null; echo \"===CARD_DIR contents===\"; ls -la /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/ 2>/dev/null","description":"Read KEY_DECISIONS, FILES_MODIFIED, card dir listing"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7143,"cache_read_input_tokens":25845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7143,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CEQK4iuzVq89pcNhCfuf9F","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"a260a029-0fbf-4a06-b879-d368da5efa25","request_id":"req_011CbdWdtV7nyqjonrJGtWNc","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_97 planeswalker + engine support"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BWydyRQfkdmnsouVoi97Jk","type":"tool_result","content":"# Key Decisions\n\nPersistent conventions and decisions across runs. Append-only.\n\n## Engine: \"exile instead of graveyard\" for free-cast spells (sos_1)\nFor a non-permanent spell with \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard,\nexile it instead\": set `card._exile_instead_of_graveyard = True` on the spell\nobject before casting it. `engine/casting.py::_resolve_spell` honors this opt-in\nflag and routes the resolving instant/sorcery from the stack to `Zone.EXILE`\ninstead of `Zone.GRAVEYARD`, then clears the flag (one-shot). Additive and\nbackward-compatible (flag defaults absent). Reuse for cast-from-graveyard /\nimpulse effects with the same rider.\n\n## Engine: mana-spent tracking, delayed main-phase triggers, spell/ability marker (sos_57)\n- `card.mana_spent: int` — set by `engine/casting.py::cast_spell` to the\n  converted mana actually paid (after cost reduction, `effective_cost.cmc`),\n  analogous to `card.colors_spent`; `cast_spell_free` sets 0. Read via\n  `getattr(card, \"mana_spent\", 0)`. Use for any \"amount of mana spent to cast\"\n  rider. (Known gap: ignores {X} payments — would under-count X-spells.)\n- `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat=True)` in\n  `engine/events.py`, fired by `engine/turn.py` on entering precombat/postcombat\n  main phases. Paired with `GameState.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(\n  controller, callback, *, precombat=True)` (registry on GameState; delivery via\n  `engine/deferred.py::deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects`, run SYNCHRONOUSLY\n  inside `TriggerManager.fire_event` for that event type). This is the general\n  \"at the beginning of your next main phase, do X once\" mechanism. A test fires\n  it directly: `game.trigger_manager.fire_event(game,\n  BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=ctrl, controller=ctrl, precombat=True))`.\n  Effects are one-shot (removed on delivery).\n- `StackObject.is_spell: bool` (additive, default False) — set True only in the\n  casting pipeline (`cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`). Abilities on\n  the stack reuse their source permanent's `card_types`, so to distinguish a\n  SPELL from an ability on the stack (e.g. for \"counter target spell\"), check\n  `getattr(stack_obj, \"is_spell\", False)` rather than inspecting `card_types`.\n\n## Convention: preparation cards (CR 722) (sos_13)\nThe engine has no native preparation-card support. Implement a preparation card\n(two-part: a creature/permanent front face + an inset \"prepare spell\") as:\n- The inset prepare spell is its own `Instant`/`Sorcery` subclass in the same\n  `card_impl.py`, resolving via `chosen_targets`.\n- Front-face card exposes: `prepared: bool` (default False) + `is_prepared`\n  read-only alias property; `make_prepare_spell(self, game)` factory returning a\n  castable inset-spell instance; `cast_prepare_spell(self, game, target=None)`\n  which requires `prepared is True` (raise ValueError otherwise), free-casts a\n  copy of the prepare spell (without paying mana), then sets `prepared = False`\n  (unprepare per CR 722.3c).\n- \"Becomes prepared\" / \"more creatures than you\" comparisons use STANDARD MTG\n  counting: a creature is on the battlefield when its own ETB trigger resolves,\n  so it counts toward \"you\"; tokens count for their controller; \"more than\" is\n  strict `>`. Do NOT subtract the entering creature.\n\n## Convention: explicit colors attribute (sos_13)\nThe engine has no native colors field. Set `self.colors` (list of single-letter\nstrings, e.g. `[\"W\"]` or `[\"W\", \"B\"]`) explicitly on cards and tokens when color\nidentity must be observable.\n\n## Convention: cost_reduction hook reads self.controller (sos_1)\nOverride `CardImpl.cost_reduction(game)` for \"costs {N} less\" effects; the engine\nclamps the reduction to the generic portion of the cost in\n`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` (`max(0, min(raw, generic))`), so no manual\nclamping is needed. The hook may read `self.controller` (engine sets it before\nquerying).\n\n===FILES_MODIFIED===\n{\n  \"cards\": [\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_1 The Dawning Archaic: properties, graveyard cost reduction, attack-trigger free cast, and exile-instead-of-graveyard replacement\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"implementation\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"The Dawning Archaic: cost_reduction counting instants/sorceries, attacks trigger free-casting from graveyard with exile-instead flag\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"_resolve_spell honors opt-in card._exile_instead_of_graveyard flag to route a resolving instant/sorcery to exile instead of graveyard\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: front-face properties, ETB trigger registration, 1/1 W+B flying Inkling token for target player, standard-counting becomes-prepared comparison, Swords-to-Plowshares exile+victim-controller lifegain, and cast-while-prepared unprepare transition (CR 722.3c)\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"implementation\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"Emeritus of Truce front face (ETB token + standard-MTG becomes-prepared count incl. entering Emeritus) plus prepared/is_prepared, make_prepare_spell factory (SwordsToPlowshares Instant), and cast_prepare_spell free-cast-then-unprepare; no engine changes\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_4 Together as One: properties, two target requirements (target player + any target), converge-driven draw/damage/life-gain, X=0 inert, safety, and end-to-end cast\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"implementation\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"Together as One: Sorcery with converge X=len(colors_spent); target player draws X, deals X damage to any target, controller gains X life; X=0 is fully inert\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt: properties, counter-target-spell targeting (any spell, rejects self, stack zone), unconditional counter to graveyard, Wizard gate, deferred {C}=mana_spent recorded, and not-added-immediately\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"implementation\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt Instant: counter target spell unconditionally (now keys off StackObject.is_spell marker so abilities are excluded); Wizard gate schedules one-shot deferred {C}=countered spell's mana_spent at controller's next precombat main\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/stack.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"additive StackObject.is_spell flag (default False) distinguishing cast spells from abilities; copy_spell marks copies is_spell=True\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"track card.mana_spent (effective_cost.cmc after reduction) during cast_spell payment; mark spell StackObjects is_spell=True in cast_spell/cast_spell_free; cast_spell_free sets mana_spent=0\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"add BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, controller, precombat) TriggeredEvent\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/game_state.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"add main_phase_deferred_effects registry + schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(controller, callback, precombat=True) one-shot delayed-effect API\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/triggers.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"TriggerManager.fire_event delivers main-phase deferred one-shots synchronously when a BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent fires\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent on entering PRECOMBAT_MAIN (precombat=True) and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN (precombat=False)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/deferred.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"new helper deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects: run+remove deferred one-shots matching event controller/precombat\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n===CARD_DIR contents===\ntotal 28\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jun  2 00:46 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jun  2 00:40 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 3335 Jun  2 00:46 coordinator-directives.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node   37 Jun  2 00:45 test-files.txt\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 6428 Jun  2 00:45 test-rationale.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1389 Jun  2 00:45 untestable.json","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CEQK4iuzVq89pcNhCfuf9F","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"9e414240-2f02-40ae-8393-93b0387156ef","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:47:41.308Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_97 planeswalker + engine support"}
