{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019FjC3Yg4WQJQBFnLquD2dB","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed a thorough review of the diff. Verified:\n- Card properties match spec (`{1}{B}{B}`, loyalty 3, Legendary, \"Ral\" subtype, `self.colors = [\"B\"]`).\n- +1 Surveil 2 correctly handles empty library (no-op), processes top-2 with top-first via `reversed(library.top(2))`, bins via `choose_yes_no`, keeps rest on top.\n- −1 reads `_resolve_targets`, safe on empty list / empty hand, routes through `discard`.\n- −2 re-validates creature + `mana_cost.cmc <= 3` + presence in controller's graveyard, no-ops on non-creature/MV≥4/missing.\n- −7 flips five coins via `flip_coins`, records `_last_heads`, adds to opponent `skipped_turns`, no-target safe.\n- Coin-flip injection consumes `_forced_coin_flips` from the front (popleft/pop(0)) then falls back to `rng`.\n- Skip-turn rotation refactor preserves existing `extra_turns` FIFO behavior (the no-skip path is identical to the old inline logic, confirmed against engine_tests/test_extra_turns.py expectations) and decrements/advances correctly per the sos_97 deterministic tests.\n- All engine changes are additive (no renames/moves/deletes); card lives at the correct path; no `engine_tests/` or FDN test modifications.\n\nThe two issues found are minor robustness nitpicks (advisory), no strict/blocking problems.\n\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 0\nadvisory_count: 2\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/review.json"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: abc49dc9e5f803813 (use SendMessage with to: 'abc49dc9e5f803813' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 71118\ntool_uses: 19\nduration_ms: 102628</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"091bfe4b-efcf-46b7-8a8d-f181a4e80afd","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:55:44.950Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"You are reviewing the implementation diff for a single MTG planeswalker plus supporting engine changes.\n\nCARD: sos_97 (Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer — {1}{B}{B} Legendary Planeswalker, loyalty 3)\n- Diff to review: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl.diff`\n- Implementer's rationale: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-rationale.md`\n- Spec: `cards/sos/sos_97/card_spec.json`\n- Prior-card conventions accepted this run: `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`\n- Persistent conventions: `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`\n\nCONTEXT the coordinator already mandated (do NOT re-litigate these design choices):\n- Coin-flip helpers `flip_coin/flip_coins` in engine/game.py with deterministic injection via `game._forced_coin_flips` (front-consumed) then `game.rng`; heads recorded on `pw._last_heads`.\n- Skip-turn support via `Player.skipped_turns` honored by `GameState.advance_phase`/`_select_next_active_player`, with `extra_turns` FIFO preserved.\n- Planeswalker conventions: `get_loyalty_abilities()` → 4 `LoyaltyAbility`; targeted abilities read `pw._resolve_target`/`pw._resolve_targets`; surveil keep/bin via `choose_yes_no`.\n\nREVIEW FOR (within those decisions):\n- Correctness vs spec/MTG rules: +1 Surveil 2 (top two only, bin any number, rest stay on top, empty-library no-op); −1 any number of target players each discard one; −2 return target creature card with mana value (mana_cost.cmc) ≤ 3 from YOUR graveyard to battlefield (non-creature/MV≥4/missing = no-op); −7 flip five coins, target opponent skips next X turns (X = heads), no-target no-op.\n- REAL BUGS in the engine changes: does the skip-turn loop in `_select_next_active_player` risk an infinite loop, mis-decrement, skip the wrong player, or corrupt `turn_number`/`extra_turns`? Does it change existing turn behavior when no one is skipped? Is the coin-flip injection consumed correctly (front order, exhaustion fallback)? Are all engine changes additive (no rename/move/delete)?\n- Missed edge cases and convention violations VISIBLE IN THE DIFF.\n- Color identity: cost is {1}{B}{B}; `self.colors` should reflect black.\n\nIMPORTANT SCOPING:\n- Do NOT flag the approved design choices above as \"wrong approach\" — only genuine BUGS within them.\n- Do NOT flag patterns from earlier cards (FILES_MODIFIED.json) or KEY_DECISIONS.md.\n- Do NOT demand test rewrites — tests were arbitrated. Test-quality concerns are `advisory` only.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/review.json` — JSON array of {\"severity\": \"strict\"|\"advisory\", \"file\": \"...\", \"line\": <n>, \"comment\": \"...\"}. `strict` only for must-fix correctness/bug/contract issues (especially turn-rotation regressions or ability bugs). [] if none.\n\nReturn ONLY:\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: <N>\nadvisory_count: <N>\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/review.json","agentId":"abc49dc9e5f803813","agentType":"Reviewer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed a thorough review of the diff. Verified:\n- Card properties match spec (`{1}{B}{B}`, loyalty 3, Legendary, \"Ral\" subtype, `self.colors = [\"B\"]`).\n- +1 Surveil 2 correctly handles empty library (no-op), processes top-2 with top-first via `reversed(library.top(2))`, bins via `choose_yes_no`, keeps rest on top.\n- −1 reads `_resolve_targets`, safe on empty list / empty hand, routes through `discard`.\n- −2 re-validates creature + `mana_cost.cmc <= 3` + presence in controller's graveyard, no-ops on non-creature/MV≥4/missing.\n- −7 flips five coins via `flip_coins`, records `_last_heads`, adds to opponent `skipped_turns`, no-target safe.\n- Coin-flip injection consumes `_forced_coin_flips` from the front (popleft/pop(0)) then falls back to `rng`.\n- Skip-turn rotation refactor preserves existing `extra_turns` FIFO behavior (the no-skip path is identical to the old inline logic, confirmed against engine_tests/test_extra_turns.py expectations) and decrements/advances correctly per the sos_97 deterministic tests.\n- All engine changes are additive (no renames/moves/deletes); card lives at the correct path; no `engine_tests/` or FDN test modifications.\n\nThe two issues found are minor robustness nitpicks (advisory), no strict/blocking problems.\n\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 0\nadvisory_count: 2\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/review.json"}],"totalDurationMs":102628,"totalTokens":71118,"totalToolUseCount":19,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1801,"cache_read_input_tokens":68745,"output_tokens":570,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1801},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":68745,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1801,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1801,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":13,"searchCount":5,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":1,"linesAdded":15,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
