{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5iQQ9nCi8cf5AhPR7PzfP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Delivery of delayed / one-shot deferred effects.\n2\t\n3\tThe engine schedules one-shot effects that should run \"at the beginning of a\n4\tplayer's next (precombat) main phase\" on\n5\t:attr:`GameState.main_phase_deferred_effects` via\n6\t:meth:`GameState.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect`.\n7\t\n8\tThis module delivers those effects when the matching\n9\t:class:`~engine.events.BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` fires.  Delivery is\n10\tinvoked from :meth:`engine.triggers.TriggerManager.fire_event` so that firing\n11\tthe event (the way tests fire ETB events) runs the scheduled callbacks directly\n12\tand removes them — they are one-shot.\n13\t\"\"\"\n14\t\n15\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n16\t\n17\tfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n18\t\n19\tfrom engine.events import BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent\n20\t\n21\tif TYPE_CHECKING:\n22\t    from engine.game_state import GameState\n23\t\n24\t\n25\tdef deliver_main_phase_deferred_effects(\n26\t    game: GameState,\n27\t    event: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent,\n28\t) -> None:\n29\t    \"\"\"Run and remove any deferred effects matching *event*.\n30\t\n31\t    A scheduled effect matches when its ``controller`` is the event's\n32\t    controller/player and (when the effect requested ``precombat``) the event\n33\t    is for the precombat main phase.  Matching effects run exactly once and\n34\t    are removed from the registry.\n35\t    \"\"\"\n36\t    pending = getattr(game, \"main_phase_deferred_effects\", None)\n37\t    if not pending:\n38\t        return\n39\t\n40\t    target = getattr(event, \"controller\", None) or getattr(event, \"player\", None)\n41\t    is_precombat = getattr(event, \"precombat\", True)\n42\t\n43\t    remaining: list[dict] = []\n44\t    to_run: list[dict] = []\n45\t    for entry in pending:\n46\t        if entry.get(\"controller\") is not target:\n47\t            remaining.append(entry)\n48\t            continue\n49\t        if entry.get(\"precombat\", True) and not is_precombat:\n50\t            # Effect wants the precombat main phase but this is postcombat.\n51\t            remaining.append(entry)\n52\t            continue\n53\t        to_run.append(entry)\n54\t\n55\t    # Replace the registry first so callbacks that schedule further effects\n56\t    # are not clobbered.\n57\t    game.main_phase_deferred_effects = remaining\n58\t\n59\t    for entry in to_run:\n60\t        callback = entry.get(\"callback\")\n61\t        if callback is not None:\n62\t            callback(game)\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XUFaNngQiH9GQk6NcaNa87","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"92a8fdea-4d9f-414c-bd37-3e47bc444e00","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:57:18.094Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_120"}
