le_main_phase_deferred_effect(controller, callback, *, precombat=True)`, `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` (engine/events.py, engine/game_state.py, engine/deferred.py).\n- Explicit `self.colors` (sos_13).\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Do NOT modify any test file in `test-files.txt`, nor `engine_tests/`, nor `cards/fdn/**/tests.py`. If a test is genuinely impossible (not just API-name preference), return DISPUTE.\n- Engine changes should be unnecessary; if truly needed, additive-only, no rename/move/delete, and keep existing behavior. Pass full regression.\n- Read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_MAP.md`, `KEY_DECISIONS.md` first. Read FDN sorceries and `engine/zones.py` (library top semantics), `engine/card.py`, `engine/casting.py`.\n\nTASK:\n1. Read directives, spec, tests, the reused surfaces.\n2. Implement Improvisation Capstone.\n3. `pytest cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py -q` until all 24 pass.\n4. `pytest engine_tests/ -q` — no regressions.\n\nOUTPUT (into $CARD_DIR = `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120`):\n- `impl.diff` — `git diff` of all changes.\n- `impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented, which surfaces you reused, any engine changes (ideally none) and why, design decisions / spec deviations (esp. how the recurring Paradigm trigger re-schedules itself, and the free-cast selection protocol).\n- `impl-files.txt` — files created/modified, one per line.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_120\"`; replace in place). Entry shape:\n  {\"card\": \"sos_120\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}]}\n\nReturn ONLY:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n\nOR:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}