{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Py3iJNn4aHW2FyNQXB9vWH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator directives — sos_120 (Improvisation Capstone)\n2\t\n3\t`{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson, mythic, **Paradigm** keyword. Verify against\n4\t`cards/sos/sos_120/card_spec.json`.\n5\t\n6\tOracle:\n7\t> Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile cards with total mana\n8\t> value 4 or greater. You may cast any number of spells from among them without\n9\t> paying their mana costs.\n10\t> Paradigm (Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with this\n11\t> name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the\n12\t> beginning of each of your first main phases.)\n13\t\n14\t## Implementation requirements\n15\t\n16\t### Clause 1 — exile-until-MV-4\n17\tExile cards one at a time off the TOP of the controller's library, accumulating\n18\t`mana_cost.cmc`, stopping as soon as the cumulative total is ≥ 4 (the boundary\n19\tcard may push it over). MV-0 cards add 0 and do NOT stop the loop. Terminate\n20\tsafely if the library empties before reaching 4 (no hang/raise). Empty library\n21\tis a safe no-op.\n22\t\n23\t### Clause 2 — free-cast from the exiled pile (REQUIRED selection convention)\n24\t\"You may cast any number of spells from among them without paying their mana\n25\tcosts.\" Use the **sos_1 `choose_yes_no`-per-eligible-spell convention** (see\n26\tKEY_DECISIONS sos_1 / `cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`): iterate the exiled NONLAND\n27\tcards, ask the controller `choose_yes_no` per eligible spell, and free-cast the\n28\taccepted ones from exile (mirror `cast_spell_free(game, controller, card,\n29\tZone.EXILE)`). LANDS in the pile can never be cast (skip them entirely).\n30\tDeclining leaves cards in exile; accepting moves the card out of exile (onto the\n31\tstack) without paying mana. This matches the Tester's scripted positive-cast\n32\ttests — follow it so those tests pass.\n33\t\n34\t### Clause 3 — Paradigm\n35\t- \"Then exile this spell\": the resolved Improvisation Capstone goes to EXILE\n36\t  instead of the graveyard. Use the sos_1 `_exile_instead_of_graveyard = True`\n37\t  opt-in (KEY_DECISIONS sos_1) on the spell before/at resolution so the casting\n38\t  pipeline routes it to exile.\n39\t- Advertise Paradigm via a card-level marker (e.g. `self.paradigm = True` /\n40\t  `has_paradigm`) and/or the word in `rules_text` (Paradigm is not an evergreen\n41\t  `Keyword`).\n42\t- \"After you first resolve a spell with this name, you may cast a copy of it from\n43\t  exile without paying its mana cost at the beginning of EACH of your first main\n44\t  phases.\" On first resolution, schedule a RECURRING precombat-main-phase effect\n45\t  for the controller using the sos_57 surface\n46\t  (`game.schedule_main_phase_deferred_effect(controller, callback,\n47\t  precombat=True)` + `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`). That surface is\n48\t  ONE-SHOT, so the callback MUST RE-SCHEDULE ITSELF each time it fires so the\n49\t  offer recurs every precombat main phase (the Tester asserts a scheduled effect\n50\t  for the controller still exists after one fires and is declined). When the\n51\t  effect fires, offer the controller (`choose_yes_no`) to cast a free copy of the\n52\t  Capstone from exile.\n53\t\n54\t## Conventions / constraints\n55\t- Set `self.colors = [\"R\"]` (explicit-colors convention, KEY_DECISIONS sos_13).\n56\t- \"Lesson\" subtype on the type line.\n57\t- Read library top correctly (the Tester's `_set_library` puts index -1 on top,\n58\t  matching `ZoneContainer.add(position=\"top\")`).\n59\t- Reuse existing engine surfaces; do NOT add new engine APIs unless strictly\n60\t  necessary. If you do touch engine, additive-only, no rename/move/delete, and\n61\t  pass full regression.\n62\t- Do NOT modify any test file, `engine_tests/`, or `cards/fdn/**/tests.py`.\n63\t\n64\tMake ALL 24 tests in `cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py` pass. If a test is genuinely\n65\timpossible (not just an API-name preference), return DISPUTE.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MgVHaaugGQm27LxaZDymC1","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"c514bb5c-2d27-46a8-a3c5-0a3351f803b8","timestamp":"2026-06-02T01:06:36.373Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120 (retry)"}
