{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UtpCPeDJRZ23MXUB9icVCk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All output files are written and the implementation is complete.\n\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 5\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Lorehold (flying/haste, MIRACLE_COST/grant_miracle/grants_miracle_to, opponent-upkeep rummage) + additive deterministic miracle pipeline (cast_spell alternative_cost, gated draw_card _offer_miracle, per-turn cards_drawn_this_turn); 1168 passed\n```\n\nSummary of what I built:\n- Card at `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py`: `LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature)` with flying+haste, `MIRACLE_COST = {2}`, `grant_miracle`/`grants_miracle_to`, and one opponent-only `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` rummage trigger (discard-then-draw, empty-hand safe no-op).\n- Additive miracle pipeline: `engine/casting.py` `cast_spell` gained a backward-compatible `alternative_cost=None` parameter (pays the alt cost, skips reduction + sorcery-speed timing, records `mana_spent`); `engine/game.py` `draw_card` now calls a fully-gated `_offer_miracle` helper; `engine/player.py` documents `cards_drawn_this_turn`; `engine/turn.py` resets it per turn. The default (no-miracle) path is unchanged, so the full engine regression stays green.\n- All 23 sos_201 tests and the entire `engine_tests/` suite pass (1168 total). The `grants_miracle_to`, `miracle_cost`, and alternative-cost cast surfaces are real/importable and verified end-to-end for the upcoming Tester draw-time probe.\n- `FILES_MODIFIED.json` upserted in place for `sos_201` (entries kept sorted by card).\n\nNote: `RUN_DECISIONS.md` and `run_manifest.json` appear modified in `git status` but were not touched by me (pre-existing), so `impl.diff` is scoped to only my five files."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a9abbab82eb6a39c9 (use SendMessage with