 no-op unless (a) it's the drawing player's FIRST card this turn (`player.cards_drawn_this_turn`) AND (b) a controlled permanent grants miracle via `grants_miracle_to(self, card) -> ManaCost|None`. When both hold, stamp `miracle_cost` and offer `choose_yes_no` to cast for the miracle cost.\n\n## Engine API discovery\nRead engine source directly (rich docstrings): `engine/card.py`, `engine/casting.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/game.py`, `engine/zones.py`, `engine/stack.py`. Use the completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_*/card_impl.py` as examples.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/)\n- `impl.diff` — unified diff of all changes (card_impl.py + engine files).\n- `impl-rationale.md` — design rationale, including the documented miracle modeling simplification and any engine changes.\n- `impl-files.txt` — list of files changed.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_201\"`, replace in place if it exists). Entry shape:\n  `{ \"card\": \"sos_201\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}] }`\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL sos_201 tests must pass and engine_tests must stay green.\n\n## Return status summary (exactly one of)\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```\nor\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```\nNote: there will be a single Tester re-invocation AFTER you finish to add a deterministic draw-time miracle test against the surface you build, so make `grants_miracle_to`, `miracle_cost`, and the alternative-cost cast path real and importable.","agentId":"a9abbab82eb6a39c9","agentType