{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a4c4fd4fe7e3aebcd","tool_use_id":"toolu_01DP4Xs2cvbpN88ARbBpN9ZM","description":"Editing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":75761,"tool_uses":27,"duration_ms":155226},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"56053b14-077f-4ef8-b7bd-13831da65626","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_016Evwod43YWBVuX8kaV36Vs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RqnQ5pNEr4ZGLWUQVxFQis","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","old_string":"Assumed contract (documented so the Coordinator/Implementer can align): a card\nmethod `grant_miracle(game)` and a `MIRACLE_COST` class/instance constant. The\ndeeper timing rule — \"you may cast it for {2} when you draw it if it's the first\ncard you drew this turn\" — depends on a draw→reveal→cast-for-alternative-cost\npipeline that the engine does not have, so that portion is recorded in\n`untestable.json`.","new_string":"Assumed contract (documented so the Coordinator/Implementer can align): a card\nmethod `grant_miracle(game)` and a `MIRACLE_COST` class/instance constant. The\ndeeper timing rule — \"you may cast it for {2} when you draw it if it's the first\ncard you drew this turn\" — was originally recorded as untestable (no engine\nsurface existed). The Implementer has since built a deterministic at-draw miracle\npipeline, so that requirement is now covered by `TestLoreholdDrawTimeMiracle`\nbelow and `untestable.json` is now empty.\n\n## TestLoreholdDrawTimeMiracle — draw-time miracle window (post-implementation hardening)\nThe Implementer added an additive, gated draw hook in `engine/game.py::draw_card`\n(via `_offer_miracle`) plus an `alternative_cost` kwarg on\n`engine/casting.py::cast_spell`, and `grants_miracle_to(card)` on Lorehold. These\ntests drive the **real** `engine.game.draw_card` (no mocking of the system under\ntest) to lock the contract. The drawn card is placed on top of the library (last\nobject added — `ZoneContainer` orientation), the controller is a scripted\n`DeterministicPlayer`, and `cards_drawn_this_turn` is reset to 0 before each\ndraw so the first-card gate is exercised deterministically.\n\n- `test_first_card_yes_casts_for_miracle_cost` — first-card instant + Lorehold on\n  the battlefield + `choose_yes_no -> yes`: the card's `miracle_cost` is stamped\n  `{2}`, the card leaves hand and is on the stack (StackObject sourced from the\n  card), the {2} cost is paid (pool drained from 2 → 0), and `mana_spent == 2`\n  (the alternative cost's cmc). This is the precise behavior the untestable item\n  asked for.\n- `test_first_card_no_keeps_card_and_spends_no_mana` — same setup but\n  `choose_yes_no -> no`: the card stays in hand, nothing goes on the stack, and\n  no mana is spent (`mana_spent` absent). The offer is declined cleanly.\n- `test_non_first_card_draw_is_not_offered` — a non-spell card is drawn first\n  (so `cards_drawn_this_turn` becomes 1), then the instant is drawn second. The\n  first-card gate fails, so there is NO offer: the instant just enters hand, the\n  stack stays empty, no mana is spent, and `miracle_cost` is never stamped. The\n  empty yes/no script proves no prompt was issued (a stray prompt would raise\n  `ScriptExhaustedError`).\n- `test_no_miracle_grantor_means_no_offer` — first-card instant with NO granting\n  permanent on the battlefield: the hook is a complete no-op (no prompt — empty\n  script confirms `remaining_choices == 0`, no stamp, no mana spent, card simply\n  enters hand). Regression-safety for the gate that keeps ordinary draws\n  unchanged.\n- `test_first_card_sorcery_also_offered_and_cast` — mirrors the instant 'yes'\n  path with a sorcery on top, proving the at-draw grant applies to both instant\n  and sorcery card types."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":620,"cache_read_input_tokens":74991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":620,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DP4Xs2cvbpN88ARbB