he drawn card for that cost (card leaves hand, mana pool reduced by the cost). Otherwise the hook is a complete no-op (no prompt, no state change).\n\nRead `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/coordinator-directives.md` for the full design, and `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md` for the modeling simplification (immediate at-draw offer).\n\n## Test to add (deterministic draw-time miracle)\nAdd to `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` a focused test class covering:\n1. First-card draw with Lorehold on the controller's battlefield + an instant/sorcery on top of library: the controller is offered (`choose_yes_no` returns yes) → the card is cast for `{2}` (mana pool reduced by 2, card leaves hand / goes to stack or resolves per the engine), and `miracle_cost` was stamped.\n2. Decline path: same setup but `choose_yes_no` returns no → card stays in hand, no mana spent.\n3. Non-first-card draw (draw a card first so `cards_drawn_this_turn` > 0, then draw the instant): NO offer, card simply enters hand.\nOptionally: a draw when no miracle-granting permanent is in play → no offer (regression-safety of the gate).\n\nUse the existing test conventions in the file and in `/workspace/engine_tests/` (look at an example like `engine_tests/test_casting.py`). Drive the real engine (`draw_card`, real `GameState`/players, stub `choose_yes_no`/`choose_card` as the file already does). Tests must PASS against the implemented surface (this is post-implementation hardening, not red-phase).\n\n## Engine discovery\nRead engine source directly: `engine/game.py` (draw_card, cards_drawn_this_turn), `engine/casting.py` (cast_spell alternative_cost), `engine/card.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL tests (old + new) must pass and engine_tests must stay green.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/)\n- Append/update `test-rationale.md` with a section describing the new draw-time miracle tests (note the untestable item is now covered).\n- Ensure `test-files.txt` still lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`.\n- If after building you find any sub-requirement still genuinely untestable, write/update `untestable.json`; otherwise leave it covered.\n\n## Return a short status summary\nReport: number of tests added, whether all pass, and whether the untestable item is now covered (untestable_count).","agentId":"a4c4fd4fe7e3aebcd","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All green. Done.\n\n## Summary\n\nI extended `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` with a new test class `TestLoreholdDrawTimeMiracle` covering the previously-untestable draw-time miracle behavior. No existing tests were modified or weakened — this is purely additive.\n\n**Tests added: 5** (in `TestLoreholdDrawTimeMiracle`)\n1. `test_first_card_yes_casts_for_miracle_cost` — first-card instant + Lorehold + yes → `miracle_cost` stamped `{2}`, card leaves hand and is on the stack (StackObject sourced from the card), pool drained 2→0, `mana_spent == 2`.\n2. `test_first_card_no_keeps_card_and_spends_no_mana` — decline path: card stays in hand, stack empty, no mana spent.\n3. `test_non_first_card_draw_is_not_offered` — draw a non-spell first (so `cards_drawn_this_turn` becomes 1), then the instant second: no offer, no stamp, no mana, card just enters hand (empty yes/no script proves no prompt was issued).\n4. `test_no_miracle_grantor_means_no_offer` — no granting permanent → complete no-op (empty script, no stamp, no mana), regression-safety for the gate.\n5. `test_first_card_sorcery_also_offered_and_cast` — sorceries get the at-draw grant too, mirroring the instant yes path.\n\nAll tests drive the real engine (`engine.game.draw_card`, real `GameState`/`DeterministicPlayer`, scripted `choose_yes_no` via the `scripts` arg) — nothing about the system under test is mocked.\n\n**Results:**\n- `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`: 28 passed (23 prior + 5 new).\n- Full run `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py engine_tests/`: 1173 passed, engine_tests remain green (24 warnings are pre-existing, unrelated cleanup-discard artifacts).\n\n**Untestable item: now covered.** `untestable_count: 0`. Updated `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/untestable.json` to `[]`.\n\n**Output files updated:**\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md` — added a `TestLoreholdDrawTimeMiracle` section and updated the \"NOT covered\" note to reflect the now-covered requirement.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-files.txt` — already correctly lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` (no change needed).\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/untestable.json` — now `[]`.\n\nTest file (absolute path): `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`"}],"totalDurationMs":176943,"totalTokens":78974,"totalToolUseCount":29,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":150,"cache_read_input_tokens":77866,"output_tokens":956,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":150},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":956,"cache_read_input_tokens":77866,"cache_creation_input_tokens":150,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":150,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":7,"editFileCount":5,"linesAdded":246,"linesRemoved":25,"otherToolCount":0}}}
