{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017BBxwpqj2jPWvTLNci9aTG","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/triggers.py:27:class TriggerRegistration:\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-28-    \"\"\"Describes a single triggered ability.\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-29-\nengine/triggers.py-30-    Attributes:\nengine/triggers.py-31-        event_type: The event class (or a base class) this trigger watches.\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-32-            The trigger fires for any fired event that is an instance of\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-33-            this class, including instances of subclasses.\nengine/triggers.py-34-        condition: Optional callable ``(game, event) -> bool`` that must\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-35-            return ``True`` for the trigger to fire.  ``None`` means the\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-36-            trigger always fires for its event type.\nengine/triggers.py-37-        effect: Callable ``(game) -> None`` executed when the trigger\nengine/triggers.py-38-            resolves (becomes the :attr:`StackObject.on_resolve` callback).\nengine/triggers.py-39-        source: The game object (card / permanent) that owns this trigger.\nengine/triggers.py-40-        controller: The player who controls the source at the time of\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-41-            registration.\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-42-    \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-43-\nengine/triggers.py-44-    event_type: type[TriggeredEvent]\nengine/triggers.py-45-    condition: Callable[..., bool] | None\nengine/triggers.py-46-    effect: Callable[..., None]\nengine/triggers.py-47-    source: Any\nengine/triggers.py-48-    controller: Player\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-49-\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-50-\nengine/triggers.py-51-class TriggerManager:\n/workspace/engine/triggers.py-52-    \"\"\"Central registry for triggered abilities."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CQVE79ZRFUJsgcJV9oB18J","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-