{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QXv1m73YHLEgTjXkPB8jPc","type":"tool_result","content":"FILES_MODIFIED.json:113:          \"summary\": \"additive StackObject.is_spell flag (default False) distinguishing cast spells from abilities; copy_spell marks copies is_spell=True\"\nKEY_DECISIONS.md:69:  casting pipeline (`cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`). Abilities on\nengine/stack.py:78:def copy_spell(\ncards/fdn/fdn_248/card_impl.py:33:        from engine.stack import copy_spell\ncards/fdn/fdn_248/card_impl.py:98:                copy_obj = copy_spell(game, original_so, ctrl, new_targets)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RTAjsfjPH76zUPLLeiM977","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"d997951f-b3d6-41f7-baf2-88f5f59250be","timestamp":"2026-06-02T01:33:23.038Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_226"}
