 controller) — all WITHOUT any manual `offer_casualty` call.\n2. No-grantor regression: casting an instant through `cast_spell` when NO casualty-granting permanent is in play produces no sacrifice, no copy, and issues no casualty prompt (use an empty/exhausted script to prove no prompt was made).\nOptionally: decline-at-cast (Silverquill out, but `choose_yes_no` says no) → spell on stack, no copy, no sacrifice.\n\nUse the existing test conventions in the file and in `/workspace/engine_tests/`. Tests must PASS against the implemented surface (post-implementation hardening, not red-phase).\n\n## Engine discovery\nRead engine source directly: `engine/casting.py` (cast_spell + the new casualty hook), `engine/stack.py`, `engine/card.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL tests (old + new) must pass and engine_tests must stay green.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/)\n- Append/update `test-rationale.md` with a section describing the new auto-fire tests (note the untestable item is now covered).\n- Ensure `test-files.txt` still lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py`.\n- Update `untestable.json` to `[]` if the item is now covered; otherwise explain what remains.\n\n## Return a short status summary\nReport: number of tests added, whether all pass, and `untestable_count: <N>`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SpkiziQuMtqYjFbVkMUryX","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"fc28b909-3a07-4999-b62e-632f508f6b0f","timestamp":"2026-06-02T01:43:16.180Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_226 tests: casualty auto-fire"}
