{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01PyKZzFL21Dn8EA1qcViRtR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NL3pKARdqVLD5AyvLZwB2J","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md","old_string":"### TestSilverquillCastingIntegration (1)\n`test_offer_casualty_on_really_cast_spell` — casts an instant through the REAL\n`engine.casting.cast_spell`, locates the genuine spell `StackObject` the engine\npushed, then drives `offer_casualty` against it and asserts the sacrifice +\nsingle copy. This proves the offer composes with a real cast (not just a\nhand-built StackObject).","new_string":"### TestSilverquillCastingIntegration (1)\n`test_offer_casualty_on_really_cast_spell` — casts an instant through the REAL\n`engine.casting.cast_spell`, locates the genuine spell `StackObject` the engine\npushed, then drives `offer_casualty` against it and asserts the sacrifice +\nsingle copy. This proves the offer composes with a real cast (not just a\nhand-built StackObject).\n\n### TestSilverquillCasualtyAutoFire (3) — added post-implementation\nThese tests cover the requirement previously recorded as untestable: the\nAUTOMATIC firing of the casualty offer during `engine.casting.cast_spell`. The\nImplementer added a fully-gated, additive cast hook (`_offer_casualty`) that\nfires after the spell `StackObject` is pushed. Each test drives the REAL\n`engine.casting.cast_spell` with NO manual `offer_casualty` call:\n- `test_cast_spell_auto_fires_casualty_and_makes_one_copy` — accept path:\n  Silverquill plus a power>=1 fodder on the caster's battlefield, the controller\n  casts an instant, the script accepts casualty (pay → sacrifice the fodder →\n  decline new targets). Asserts the fodder moved battlefield→graveyard and that\n  exactly one distinct copy (`is_spell=True`, `controller is p1`, same name as\n  the original) sits on the stack alongside the original — all without any\n  manual offer call. Because the offer fires inside `cast_spell`, the decisions\n  are scripted ahead of the cast; the script is fully consumed\n  (`remaining_choices == 0`).\n- `test_cast_spell_no_grantor_does_not_prompt_or_copy` — no-grantor regression:\n  a power>=1 creature exists but nothing grants casualty (no dragon). The script\n  is left EMPTY on purpose, so any prompt would raise `ScriptExhaustedError`.\n  Asserts no sacrifice, no copy, only the original spell on the stack, and no\n  prompt issued.\n- `test_cast_spell_decline_casualty_leaves_no_copy` — decline-at-cast:\n  Silverquill is in play but `choose_yes_no` returns `False`, so the spell stays\n  on the stack with no copy and no sacrifice; the single decline answer is\n  consumed.\n\nThe instants used here have no targets (`get_targets` defaults to `[]`), so\ncasting consumes no script entries before the casualty hook — the scripted\nanswers map one-to-one onto the offer's decisions."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":60619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":325,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SpkiziQuMtqYjFbVkMUryX","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"5eac7905-91fd-46b5-9fa1-3ed7fc9be03b","request_id":"req_011CbdaxsjyKjTLoS8vi9qnz","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_226 tests: casualty auto-fire"}
