eries.\n- Flying/vigilance, legendary, colors (`self.colors == [\"W\",\"B\"]`), Elder Dragon subtypes correctness.\n- Reuses existing `copy_spell` / `StackObject.is_spell` rather than reimplementing copy logic.\n\n## Constraints\n- Read `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` and `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`. Do NOT flag patterns introduced by earlier cards (listed in FILES_MODIFIED.json) or conventions established in KEY_DECISIONS.md (explicit self.colors, mana_spent, BeginningOfMainPhase, StackObject.is_spell, coin flips/skip-turns, preparation cards, alternative-cost/miracle draw hook, etc.).\n- Do NOT demand test rewrites — tests were already arbitrated. Test-quality issues are `advisory` only.\n\n## Output\nWrite `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/review.json` as a JSON array of objects:\n`{\"severity\": \"strict\"|\"advisory\", \"file\": \"<path>\", \"line\": <n>, \"comment\": \"<text>\"}`. Use `strict` only for real correctness/spec/convention defects that must be fixed; everything else is `advisory`. Empty array `[]` if no findings.\n\n## Return status summary\n```\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: <N>\nadvisory_count: <N>\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/review.json\n```","agentId":"aaa82cfc087c6108e","agentType":"Reviewer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 1\nadvisory_count: 2\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/review.json"}],"totalDurationMs":107518,"totalTokens":62167,"totalToolUseCount":22,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1659,"cache_read_input_tokens":60453,"output_tokens":53,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1659},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":53,"cache_read_input_tokens":60453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1659,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":