e in place).\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL sos_226 tests pass; engine_tests stay green.\n\n## Return status summary\n```\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: <N>\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/disagreements.json\n```"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FWkbLwQU8VHJEPVBvDNHZC","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"03e68cf4-d500-4a49-a49a-318a95fbb38f","timestamp":"2026-06-02T01:47:11.744Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_226 per review"}
