ne/casting.py::get_cost_reduction` (or add a fully-gated helper it calls) so\nit ALSO sums reductions granted by permanents the CASTER controls:\n- For each permanent the caster controls, getattr-safe check\n  `grants_affinity_to(spell)`; if truthy, add `affinity_reduction(game)` to the\n  raw reduction before the existing generic-clamp (`max(0, min(raw, generic))`).\n- This must be COMPLETELY no-op when no controlled permanent grants affinity, so\n  the default reduction path and all engine_tests stay byte-for-byte equivalent.\n  Use getattr-safe capability probing (most permanents lack these methods).\n- Keep the existing single-source clamp semantics; the granted reduction is added\n  into the same raw total and clamped to the generic portion together.\n\nReuse the established grant-capability PATTERN (sos_226 `_offer_casualty`,\nsos_201 miracle). Additive only — no renaming/moving/deleting engine symbols.\n\n## Constraints\n- DO NOT modify any test file in `test-files.txt`. If a test is genuinely wrong,\n  return DISPUTE.\n- Run `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`; all\n  sos_245 tests pass and engine_tests stay green.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3484,"cache_read_input_tokens":69315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3484},"output_tokens":64,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"c77b96ab-dad4-4932-b1ae-4d950b221300","request_id":"req_011CbdbgoKEfUox27tRbnir5"}
