ce` for sacrifices).\n- Read `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` to see prior cards' files (do not undo their changes).\n- CRITICAL: Do NOT modify any file under `/workspace/engine_tests/`. Those are staged for local verification only.\n\n## Card spec & tests\n- Spec: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_spec.json`\n- Stub to fill in: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py`\n- Test file you must make pass (do NOT edit): listed in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt` (it is `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`).\n\n## Coordinator directives (authoritative design)\nRead `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/coordinator-directives.md` in full. It specifies the exact card surface (`cost_reduction`, `grants_affinity_to`, `affinity_reduction`, flying+deathtouch, B/G colors, legendary Elder Dragon) AND the additive engine change:\n- Extend `engine/casting.py::get_cost_reduction` (or a fully-gated helper it calls) so it ALSO sums reductions granted by permanents the CASTER controls via getattr-safe `grants_affinity_to(spell)` + `affinity_reduction(game)`, added into the raw total before the existing generic-clamp `max(0, min(raw, generic))`. Must be a COMPLETE no-op when no controlled permanent grants affinity (default reduction path + all engine_tests unchanged).\n\n## Engine API discovery\nRead engine source directly (rich docstrings): `engine/casting.py` (`get_cost_reduction`, `cast_spell`), `engine/card.py`, `engine/combat.py` (`_can_block`, `_get_lethal_damage` for flying/deathtouch), `engine/zones.py`. Use the FDN cost-reduction card (FDN 6 \"Claws Out\") in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as a `cost_reduction` example.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/)\n- `impl.diff` — unified diff of all changes (card_impl.py + engine files).\n- `impl-rationale.md` — design rationale, including the granted-cost-reduction wiring and any conventions worth reusing.\n- `impl-files.txt` — list of files changed.\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.js