{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HEciC8r1vVVNJZtF9HhMEz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YGTm3RKSK2yGeCH6x1tUM8","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Implement sos_257 Great Hall + restricted mana","subagent_type":"Implementer","prompt":"Implement card **sos_257** (Great Hall of the Biblioplex, a Land) and the additive engine support it requires. Make ALL tests in the test file pass without modifying any test file.\n\n## Context / workspace rules\n- Read `/workspace/AGENTS.md` and `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` for workspace rules and path conventions.\n- Read `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` for established conventions you MUST follow (explicit `self.colors`; mana_spent; the grant-capability pattern; SpellCastTriggeredEvent usage; etc.).\n- Read `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` to see prior cards' files (do not undo their changes).\n- CRITICAL: Do NOT modify any file under `/workspace/engine_tests/`. Those are staged for local verification only.\n\n## Card spec & tests\n- Spec: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_spec.json`\n- Stub to fill in: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`\n- Test file you must make pass (do NOT edit): listed in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt` (it is `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`).\n\n## Coordinator directives (authoritative design)\nRead `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/coordinator-directives.md` IN FULL. It specifies:\n- The full card surface: two `ManaAbility` ({T}:{C} and {T},Pay 1 life: any color restricted to instant/sorcery), one `{5}` `ActivatedAbility` animation (2/4 Wizard, still a Land, gated on \"isn't a creature\"), and a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` +1/+0 pump trigger gated on controller + instant/sorcery.\n- The additive restricted-mana engine surface to build (ManaPool tracking per-mana spend restrictions tagged e.g. \"instant_sorcery\"; `engine.casting` payment consulting it; BYTE-FOR-BYTE unchanged when no restricted mana