{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_016nySSpcfoeexQaUmtSG6Fu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017yGuZagkMtaoUcQNSdmX55","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation rationale — sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Path taken: BUILT the additive restricted-mana surface (not the fallback)\n\nI built a real, importable restricted-mana surface on `engine.mana.ManaPool` and\nwired `engine.casting` to consult it. The any-color ability tags its mana with\nthe `instant_sorcery` restriction, and a creature spell genuinely cannot spend\nit (raises `CastingError` if it is the only mana that could pay).\n\n## Card design (`cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`)\n\n`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land)`:\n- `mana_cost == ManaCost()`, explicit `self.colors == []`\n  (per the KEY_DECISIONS explicit-colors convention), starts untapped,\n  `can_cast` inherited `False` from `Land`.\n- Because it is a `Land` (not a `Creature`), it tracks its own P/T. `power` and\n  `toughness` are read-only properties: `power = _base_power + _power_bonus`,\n  `toughness = _base_toughness`. Before animation `_base_power/_base_toughness`\n  are 0 (tests never read P/T pre-animation).\n- `get_mana_abilities()` returns exactly two `ManaAbility`:\n  1. `{T}: Add {C}` — taps (returns `False` if already tapped), adds one\n     `ManaType.COLORLESS`. Description contains `\"{C}\"`.\n  2. `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color …` — atomic cost: if the land\n     is already tapped it returns `False` WITHOUT deducting life; otherwise taps\n     and deducts 1 life. `mana_produced` reads the color via\n     `controller.choose(...)` and adds it via\n     `add_restricted(chosen, 1, restriction=RESTRICTION_INSTANT_SORCERY)`.\n     Description contains both `\"life\"` and `\"any color\"`.\n- `get_activated_abilities()` returns exactly one `ActivatedAbility` (the `{5}`\n  animation). `cost` pays `ManaCost(generic=5)` via the controller's pool\n  (`can_pay` then `pay`), so 4 mana fails and 5 mana empties the pool. `effect`\n  is gated on \"isn't a creature\": it returns early if already animated or\n  already a creature, so a second resolution does not stack P/T. On first\n  resolution it adds `CardType.CREATURE` (keeping `CardType.LAND`), adds subtype\n  `\"Wizard\"`, sets base 2/4, and calls `register_triggers` to wire the pump.\n- `register_triggers(game)` is a no-op until animated (the land has no triggered\n  abilities before it becomes a creature), and idempotent via a guard flag so\n  the test's direct call after `effect()` does not double-register. It registers\n  a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger whose condition gates on (a) the spell's\n  caster being the land's controller (\"Whenever YOU cast\") and (b) the spell\n  being an instant or sorcery. The effect adds +1 to `_power_bonus` so\n  `power` reflects +1/+0 immediately. The casting pipeline does not itself fire\n  `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`, so this is exercised by firing the event directly\n  (sos_57 pattern), matching the tests.\n\n## Engine: additive restricted-mana surface (`engine/mana.py`)\n\n- New module-level `RESTRICTION_INSTANT_SORCERY = \"instant_sorcery\"` tag and\n  `restriction_allows(restriction, spell) -> bool`. `None` restriction = always\n  allowed; a `None` spell context (e.g. plain `can_pay`, ability payment) is\n  treated conservatively as NOT allowed for restricted mana (fail-closed so an\n  unverifiable restriction never leaks onto an illegal spell); the\n  `instant_sorcery` tag allows only spells whose `card_types` include INSTANT or\n  SORCERY; unknown tags deny by default.\n- `ManaPool` gains a parallel ledger `self._restricted: dict[ManaType, list[str]]`\n  (empty unless `add_restricted` is ever called). Restricted mana is ALSO stored\n  in the existing `_pool`, so `get`/`total` reflect it; `empty()` clears both.\n- New `add_restricted(mana_type, amount, restriction=None)` mirrors `add` but\n  records restriction tags (with `restriction=None` it is identical to `add`).\n- `can_pay(cost, spell=None)` and `pay(cost, choices=None, spell=None)` gained an\n  optional `spell` parameter. When the pool holds restricted mana, payment runs\n  against a `_spendable_pool(spell)` (the pool minus restricted mana the spell\n  may not use). On commit in the restricted path, the amount spent per type is\n  deducted from the real `_pool` and the restriction ledger is reconciled\n  (spending unrestricted mana before restricted/allowed mana of the same type).\n- **Byte-for-byte guarantee:** when no restricted mana is ever added,\n  `_has_restricted()` is `False`, `can_pay`/`pay` use `self._pool` exactly as\n  before, and the commit takes the original fast path. All 1145 engine_tests\n  stay green, and the full card+engine suite (1466 tests) passes.\n\n## Engine: payment wiring (`engine/casting.py`)\n\n`cast_spell` now passes `spell=card` to `player.mana_pool.can_pay(...)` and\n`player.mana_pool.pay(...)`. With no restricted mana in the pool this is a no-op\n(the `spell` argument is only consulted when `_has_restricted()` is true), so the\ndefault cast path is unchanged.\n\n## Conventions worth reusing\n\n- \"Spend this mana only to …\" riders (CR 106.6): produce mana with\n  `ManaPool.add_restricted(mana_type, amount, restriction=<tag>)` and add a tag\n  matcher in `engine.mana.restriction_allows`. The casting pipeline already\n  forwards the spell, so the restriction is enforced automatically. The matcher\n  fails closed for unknown tags / missing spell context.\n- Animating a non-creature `Land` into a creature while staying a land: subclass\n  `Land`, expose `power`/`toughness` as properties over `_base_*`/`_power_bonus`,\n  add `CardType.CREATURE` (union, keep `CardType.LAND`) under an \"isn't a\n  creature\" gate, and wire the creature's triggers from inside the animation\n  effect (idempotent via a guard).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_read_input_tokens":114632,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":178,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":67,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YGTm3RKSK2yGeCH6x1tUM8","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"d224bf9a-90d8-40a0-87ec-ab9ca9814bd4","request_id":"req_011Cbdcs2BnYAk3fA2GD1Ppt","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257 Great Hall + restricted mana"}
