{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PgBTcGw29X3Jfp3BewSfRx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"requirement\": \"{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\",\n4\t    \"reason\": \"The engine's ManaPool stores only a flat dict[ManaType, int] with no notion of 'restricted' mana that may be spent only on certain spell types. There is no observable surface to assert that the mana produced by this ability can pay only for an instant/sorcery and not, e.g., a creature spell. The testable subset (taps the land, pays exactly 1 life, adds exactly one mana of the chosen color) IS covered in TestAnyColorManaAbility.\",\n5\t    \"what_would_unblock\": \"An engine surface for restricted/conditional mana — e.g. ManaPool tracking per-mana spend restrictions (a tag or predicate) and casting.cast_spell consulting it so a test could try to pay a creature spell with the restricted mana and observe a CastingError, while an instant/sorcery succeeds.\"\n6\t  }\n7\t]\n8\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018vLFmRjnSPaCfdXiEUZvAu","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"69e5b0d0-b266-4159-b46a-13a3b94ef4bd","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:11:48.082Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_257 tests: restricted mana"}
