{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018vLFmRjnSPaCfdXiEUZvAu","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All green. The `test-files.txt` already correctly lists the single test file, so no change is needed there.\n\nTESTS_REWRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 4 (added; 38 total in the file)\nnotes: Added `TestInstantSorceryRestrictedMana` to `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` — 4 new tests driving the real `engine.casting.cast_spell` against the now-built restricted-mana surface. Existing 34 tests left unchanged and still pass.\nuntestable_count: 0\n\nSummary:\n- 4 tests added (all PASS):\n  - `test_restricted_mana_pays_for_instant_via_cast_spell` — card's pay-1-life ability produces restricted BLUE mana; an instant casts successfully and the mana is consumed.\n  - `test_restricted_mana_pays_for_sorcery_via_cast_spell` — `ManaPool.add_restricted(..., RESTRICTION_INSTANT_SORCERY)` GREEN mana pays for a sorcery.\n  - `test_restricted_mana_cannot_pay_for_creature` — with restricted mana as the only mana, casting a creature raises `CastingError`; mana untouched, creature stays in hand, stack empty.\n  - `test_unrestricted_mana_can_pay_for_creature_control` — control: unrestricted GREEN pays the same creature, isolating the restriction as the cause of the block.\n- Full required command `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`: 1183 passed (all old + new sos_257 tests pass; engine_tests stay green).\n- Output files updated: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md` (new section + count), `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json` set to `[]`, `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt` unchanged (already lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`).\n\nThe previously untestable \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" requirement is now fully covered. `untestable_count: 0`."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: acd8b340c96250ec2 (use SendMessage with to: 'acd8b340c96250ec2' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 69025\ntool_uses: 26\nduration_ms: 115064</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"6e24fd9d-5e8c-4882-aac7-4f5b16464d16","timestamp":"2026-06-02T02:12:25.643Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"This is a SINGLE follow-up invocation for card **sos_257** (Great Hall of the Biblioplex). You previously wrote tests and reported ONE untestable requirement (the \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" restriction on the pay-1-life any-color mana). The Implementer has now BUILT an additive restricted-mana surface, so EXTEND the existing test file with hard test(s) for that behavior. Do NOT rewrite or weaken existing passing tests — only ADD new test(s).\n\n## What was built (now real and importable)\n- `engine/mana.py` `ManaPool` gained an additive `add_restricted(...)` (mana tagged with a restriction, e.g. `\"instant_sorcery\"`) plus a `restriction_allows`-style tag check; restricted mana is tracked separately so the default pool path is byte-for-byte unchanged when no restricted mana is present.\n- `engine/casting.py` payment is now spell-aware: restricted (`instant_sorcery`) mana may pay for an instant/sorcery spell, but is treated as UNAVAILABLE for a non-matching spell (e.g. a creature) — `cast_spell` raises `CastingError` if that restricted mana is the only thing that could pay.\n- The card's pay-1-life any-color `ManaAbility` adds its mana tagged with the `instant_sorcery` restriction.\n\nRead `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/coordinator-directives.md` for the full design and `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md` for the exact surface names (`add_restricted`, the restriction tag/`restriction_allows`, and how `cast_spell` consults it). Use the real names from the rationale/source.\n\n## Test to add (deterministic restricted-mana enforcement)\nAdd a focused test class that:\n1. Produces the restricted (instant/sorcery-only) mana — either via the card's pay-1-life any-color ability or directly via `ManaPool.add_restricted(...)` — and casts an INSTANT (or sorcery) through the REAL `engine.casting.cast_spell` paying with that restricted mana: the cast SUCCEEDS and the mana is consumed.\n2. With the SAME restricted mana as the only available mana, attempts to cast a CREATURE spell through `cast_spell`: it raises `CastingError` (the restricted mana cannot pay for a non-instant/sorcery), and the pool/board state is unchanged.\nOptionally: a control showing ordinary (unrestricted) mana CAN pay a creature spell, to anchor that the restriction—not some other gap—causes the failure.\n\nUse the real engine and the file's existing conventions (look at `/workspace/engine_tests/test_casting.py` and how the existing sos_257 tests build pools/spells). Read `engine/mana.py` and `engine/casting.py` to use the exact API. Tests must PASS against the implemented surface (post-implementation hardening, not red-phase). Keep within ~30-per-card style; a small focused class (2-3 tests) is right.\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL tests (old + new) must pass and engine_tests must stay green.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/)\n- Append/update `test-rationale.md` with a section describing the new restricted-mana tests (note the untestable item is now covered).\n- Ensure `test-files.txt` still lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`.\n- Update `untestable.json` to `[]` if the item is now covered; otherwise explain what remains.\n\n## Return a short status summary\nReport: number of tests added, whether all pass, and `untestable_count: <N>`.","agentId":"acd8b340c96250ec2","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All green. The `test-files.txt` already correctly lists the single test file, so no change is needed there.\n\nTESTS_REWRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 4 (added; 38 total in the file)\nnotes: Added `TestInstantSorceryRestrictedMana` to `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` — 4 new tests driving the real `engine.casting.cast_spell` against the now-built restricted-mana surface. Existing 34 tests left unchanged and still pass.\nuntestable_count: 0\n\nSummary:\n- 4 tests added (all PASS):\n  - `test_restricted_mana_pays_for_instant_via_cast_spell` — card's pay-1-life ability produces restricted BLUE mana; an instant casts successfully and the mana is consumed.\n  - `test_restricted_mana_pays_for_sorcery_via_cast_spell` — `ManaPool.add_restricted(..., RESTRICTION_INSTANT_SORCERY)` GREEN mana pays for a sorcery.\n  - `test_restricted_mana_cannot_pay_for_creature` — with restricted mana as the only mana, casting a creature raises `CastingError`; mana untouched, creature stays in hand, stack empty.\n  - `test_unrestricted_mana_can_pay_for_creature_control` — control: unrestricted GREEN pays the same creature, isolating the restriction as the cause of the block.\n- Full required command `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`: 1183 passed (all old + new sos_257 tests pass; engine_tests stay green).\n- Output files updated: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md` (new section + count), `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json` set to `[]`, `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt` unchanged (already lists `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`).\n\nThe previously untestable \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" requirement is now fully covered. `untestable_count: 0`."}],"totalDurationMs":115064,"totalTokens":69025,"totalToolUseCount":26,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":187,"cache_read_input_tokens":68100,"output_tokens":736,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":187},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":736,"cach