nd statics: no mana cost, colorless, not a creature initially, can't be cast.\n\n## Constraints\n- Read `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` and `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`. Do NOT flag patterns introduced by earlier cards or conventions established in KEY_DECISIONS.md.\n- Do NOT demand test rewrites — tests were already arbitrated. Test-quality issues are `advisory` only.\n\n## Output\nWrite `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json` as a JSON array of objects:\n`{\"severity\": \"strict\"|\"advisory\", \"file\": \"<path>\", \"line\": <n>, \"comment\": \"<text>\"}`. Use `strict` only for real correctness/spec/convention defects that must be fixed; everything else is `advisory`. Empty array `[]` if no findings.\n\n## Return status summary\n```\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: <N>\nadvisory_count: <N>\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json\n```"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2251,"cache_read_input_tokens":96007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2251},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"a3a49eea-7309-485f-930c-c46ea39e5739","request_id":"req_011Cbdd73fDwx7oYriSsyobA"}
