{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01M7VKNjhhjCQHW2E1cswREv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014kajCAS7JGXMZP2uEy7qQf","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex — revision rationale\n\nBoth strict review findings were applied. The restricted-mana surface in\n`engine/mana.py` / `engine/casting.py` (built in the prior round) is unchanged.\n\n## Finding 1 — Animation must be a continuous effect, not direct mutation\n\n**Before:** the `{5}` effect set `source.card_types |= {CREATURE}`,\n`source.subtypes |= {\"Wizard\"}`, and `_base_power/_base_toughness` directly.\n`EffectManager.apply_all` (cleanup step, SBA recalcs) calls\n`_reset_characteristics()` on every battlefield object, which resets\n`card_types` to `_original_card_types` (`{LAND}` only). The very next recalc\nstripped `CardType.CREATURE` back off — and `_is_animated` stayed `True`, so\nthe gate then blocked re-animating, leaving a permanently non-creature land.\n\n**After:** animation is modelled as two `ContinuousEffect`s added to\n`game.effect_manager`, both `DURATION_PERMANENT`:\n\n- `Layer.TYPE` — ADDS `CardType.CREATURE` and the `\"Wizard\"` subtype on top of\n  the reset baseline (`CardType.LAND` is in `_original_card_types`, so it is\n  preserved automatically).\n- `Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS` / `SubLayer.SET_PT` — sets the land to 2/4.\n\nThe card now exposes `power`/`toughness` over `modified_power`/`modified_toughness`\n(mirroring `Creature`), and overrides `_reset_characteristics()` to reset\n`subtypes` to a snapshot `_original_subtypes` and `modified_power/toughness` to\nthe non-creature baseline 0/0. Each `apply_all` therefore re-adds CREATURE /\nWizard / 2/4 on top of the reset, so the animation survives indefinitely.\n\n`_animate` calls `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)` right after registering\nthe effects so the land reads as a 2/4 creature immediately (tests check\n`hall.power == 2` directly after `effect(game)` without driving a recalc).\n\n## Finding 2 — +1/+0 pump must be an until-end-of-turn continuous effect\n\n**Before:** the cast-trigger did `source._power_bonus += 1` on a plain\nattribute nothing ever reset, so each instant/sorcery permanently raised power.\n\n**After:** the trigger registers a per-cast\n`ContinuousEffect(layer=POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=MODIFY_PT,\nduration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` granting +1/+0 (matching fdn_69 / fdn_71), then\ncalls `apply_all` so the bump is visible immediately. Cleanup step\n(`remove_expired` + `apply_all`) sweeps it away at end of turn. The condition\nstill gates on the controller casting an instant/sorcery only, so opponents'\nspells and creature spells do not pump it.\n\nSublayer ordering guarantees correctness on recalc: 7b (SET_PT, set 2/4) runs\nbefore 7c (MODIFY_PT, +1/+0), yielding 3/4 while the pump is live and 2/4 after\nit expires.\n\n## Idempotency / gate\n\nThe \"If this land isn't a creature\" gate is enforced by `_animation_effects_added`\n(and `_is_animated`): a second `effect(game)` is a no-op for the type/P/T change\n(no duplicate effects), so re-running it keeps the land at 2/4.\n\n## Design decisions / conventions for future cards\n\n- A non-`Creature` permanent that \"becomes a creature\" should adopt the\n  `Creature`-style `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` fields and override\n  `_reset_characteristics()` to reset them to the permanent's non-creature\n  baseline, then model the animation as `Layer.TYPE` + `Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS`\n  `SET_PT` continuous effects (`DURATION_PERMANENT`). Direct attribute mutation\n  does NOT survive `EffectManager.apply_all`'s reset pass.\n- Snapshot `_original_subtypes` (alongside the base class's `_original_card_types`)\n  when a continuous effect grants a subtype, so the reset strips it cleanly.\n- Animation/pump effect callbacks call `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)`\n  after `add(...)` so characteristics reflect immediately (tests and any caller\n  that does not drive its own recalc see the change at once).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`\n  → 38 sos_257 tests pass; 1145 engine tests pass.\n- Manual sanity loop: animate -> `apply_all` recalc keeps it a 2/4 creature+land;\n  cast trigger -> 3/4; end-of-turn `remove_expired`+`apply_all` -> back to 2/4,\n  still a creature.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_read_input_tokens":77459,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1561,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hp6qb1u1az9unTEe9d7eJj","session_id":"7c2fbc8b-9529-4254-888d-bbf9dd1c7145","uuid":"612396eb-f219-49f9-bb91-11170c83ea69","request_id":"req_011CbddVtdtkpKz33qMjQw53","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_257 per review"}
