{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hp6qb1u1az9unTEe9d7eJj","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All output files are written and verified. Both strict findings were applied (no disagreements).\n\nSummary of what changed in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`:\n- **Animation (finding #1):** The `{5}` effect no longer mutates `card_types`/P-T directly. It now adds two `DURATION_PERMANENT` `ContinuousEffect`s to `game.effect_manager` — a `Layer.TYPE` effect that adds `CardType.CREATURE` + `\"Wizard\"` (keeping `CardType.LAND`), and a `Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS`/`SET_PT` effect setting 2/4. The card now exposes `power`/`toughness` over `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` (Creature-style), and overrides `_reset_characteristics()` to reset `subtypes` (via a new `_original_subtypes` snapshot) and `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` to the non-creature baseline 0/0. So the becomes-a-creature change survives every `apply_all` recalc.\n- **Pump (finding #2):** The cast trigger no longer accumulates a never-reset `_power_bonus`. It registers a per-cast `ContinuousEffect(layer=POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=MODIFY_PT, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` granting +1/+0, so it decays at cleanup. The controller-only / instant-or-sorcery gate is unchanged.\n- Both callbacks call `apply_all` immediately so characteristics reflect right away; the isn't-a-creature gate (`_animation_effects_added`) prevents double-registration.\n\nThe restricted-mana surface in `engine/mana.py` / `engine/casting.py` from the prior round is unchanged. Engine changes remain additive; engine_tests stay green.\n\n```\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n```"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ad421805f26a617ed (use SendMessage with to: 'ad421805f26a617ed' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 89338\ntool_uses: 31\ndu