e +1/+0 pump must be an until-end-of-turn continuous effect.** The cast-trigger currently does `source._power_bonus += 1` on a plain attribute that never resets, so it never decays at end of turn. Register a per-cast `ContinuousEffect(layer=POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=MODIFY_PT, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` (per fdn_69/fdn_71) granting +1/+0, so it expires correctly in the cleanup step. The pump still applies ONLY on the controller's instants/sorceries.\n\nKeep all engine changes additive; do not regress engine_tests. Keep the restricted-mana surface as built.\n\n## Output (write to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/)\n- `impl-revised.diff` — unified diff of the full revised change set.\n- `impl-revised-rationale.md` — what changed and why.\n- `disagreements.json` — JSON array of `{review_comment_index, reviewer_comment, implementer_justification}` for any strict finding you decline (use `[]` if you applied them all).\n- Upsert this card's entry in `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_257\"`, replace in place).\n\n## Verify\nRun `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py engine_tests/ -q`. ALL sos_257 tests pass; engine_tests stay green. (Tip: also sanity-check that animating then running a cleanup/`apply_all` cycle keeps the land a creature and lets the +1/+0 wear off — that's the whole point of the fix — but do NOT add or modify tests.)\n\n## Return status summary\n```\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: <N>\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n```","agentId":"ad421805f26a617ed","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All output files are written and verified. Both strict findings were applied (no disagreements).\n\nSummary of what changed in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`:\n- **Animation (finding #1):** The `{5}` effect no longer mutates `card_types`/P-T directly. It now adds two `DURATION_PERMANENT` `ContinuousEffect`s to